<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JDG" style="id">- Kwere Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">WASEMI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Wasemi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Wasemi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Was</para>
  <para style="mt1">Wasemi</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Wasemi chosimulila vinhu vilawilile umwaka va Waisilaili, viwakomeleze kuisola isi ya Kanaani. Lukala lusita lwa kumulema Mulungu na kugazigwa, maabaho kukomboligwa kaidi na kaidi. Waisilaili wakalaga wotambikila milungu ya uvwizi. Maabaho Mulungu kawagala wanhu wa zisi zimwenga kwiza kuwagaza Waisilaili. Wanhu wamulila Mulungu na kusama uhasanyi wawo, maabaho Mulungu kawagalila walangulizi watangigwe Wasemi, kuwalongoza Waisilaili na kuwakombola muna yamagayo yawo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Haimanyika yelihi yandikile chitabu chino cha Wasemi. Wanhu wengi wohuwila kuwa mwandikaji kakala mulotezi Samweli. Mbali chodaha kuvimanya chitabu chino chandikigwa lusita luja Waisilaili viwakalile na mfalume, kwaviya yolongigwa lusita lwingi kuwa Isilaili haikalile na mfalume lusita lwa Wasemi (17:6, 18:1, 19:1, na 21:25). Yahawa Waisilaili walawa Misili mwaka wa 1400 KK (Ing'hali Chilisito), vinhu muna ichitabu chino vilawilila kwandusila mwaka 1300 mbaka 1050 KK (Ing'hali Chilisito) Sauli viyahakigwe mavuta kuwa mfalume wa Isilaili.</para>
  <para style="iot">Mbuli zilimuno</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Sula ya 1 mbaka sula ya 3:6 zosimulila mbuli za ng'hondo za uhelelo za Waisilaili na Wakanaani viimalile ifa ya Yoshua. Sula zino zokwandusa kusimulila lusita lwa Wasemi, lusita Mulungu viyawagalile walangulizi kulanguliza na kuwakombola Waisilaili kulawa kwa wehi wawo.</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Sula ya 3:7 mbaka sula ya 16:31 zosimulila mbuli za Wasemi mbasakanyo wagaligwe na Mulungu kulanguliza Waisilaili.</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Sula ya 17 mbaka sula ya 21 zosimulila mbuli za lusita lumwenga Waisilaili viwamulemile Mulungu.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JDG 1" />
  <para style="s">Waisilaili wowatowa Wakanaani wasigale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 1:1" />Viifosile ifa ya Yoshua, Waisilaili wamuuza Mndewa Mulungu, “Vino kabila dilihi dondajanduse kuhita kuitowa na Wakanaani?” <verse eid="JDG 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 1:2" />Mndewa Mulungu kawedika, “Kabila da Yuda dizakwandusa kuhita kuitowa nawo. Niiguma isi iyo muna yamakono yawo.” <verse eid="JDG 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 1:3" />Wanhu wa kabila da Yuda wawalongela ndugu zawo, wanhu wa kabila da Simeoni, “Hiteni hamwe na cheye hana iisi yomwing'higwe muladi kwiitowa ng'hondo na Wakanaani. Iviya na cheye chizahita hamwe na mweye hana iisi yomwing'higwe.” Ivo wanhu wa kabila da Simeoni wahita hamwe nawo.<verse eid="JDG 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 1:4" />Wanhu wa kabila da Yuda viwahitile kuwatowa, Mndewa Mulungu kaweka Wakanaani na Wapelizi muna yamakono yawo na wawakoma wanhu 10,000 kuna ing'hondo uko Bezeki. <verse eid="JDG 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 1:5" />Uko wamuwona mfalume Adoni Bezeki, waitowa nayo na wawahuma Wakanaani na Wapelizi. <verse eid="JDG 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 1:6" />Mfalume Adoni Bezeki kakimbila, mbali wamuwinga na kumgwila. Wamkanha madole ng'hulu ya muna yamakono na muna yamagulu. <verse eid="JDG 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 1:7" />Mfalume Adoni Bezeki kalonga, “Wafalume malongo saba waja wakanhigwe madole ng'hulu ya muna yamakono na muna yamagulu wadondola masigavu ya ndiya hasi ya meza yangu. Lelo Mulungu kaniliha fana vinitendile.” Wamgala Yelusalemu na kadanganikila uko.<verse eid="JDG 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 1:8" />Walume wa kabila da Yuda wawatowa wanhu wa bululu da Yelusalemu na kudisola bululu ijo. Wawakoma kwa panga wakaya wake na waditimbula dibululu kwa moto. <verse eid="JDG 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 1:9" />Maabaho walume wa kabila da Yuda wahita kuwatowa Wakanaani wowokala muna iisi ya milima, isi ya Negebu na isi ya milima midododo ili ubanzi wa uswelo wa zuwa. <verse eid="JDG 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 1:10" />Maabaho kabila da Yuda wawasondelela Wakanaani wakalile uko Hebuloni, umwaka itangigwa Kiliasi Aliba. Nawo wawahuma wanhu wa ng'holo za Sheshai na Ahimani na Talimai.<verse eid="JDG 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 1:11" />Kulawa Hebuloni, wanhu wa kabila da Yuda wahita kuwatowa wakaya wa bululu da Debili diya umwaka ditangigwa Kiliasi Sefeli. <verse eid="JDG 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 1:12" />Kalebu kalonga, “Mulume yoyose yondayadahe kuditowa bululu da Kiliasi Sefeli na kudisola, nizamwing'ha mwanangu Akisa yawe muke wake.” <verse eid="JDG 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 1:13" />Osinieli mwana wa Kenazi yeli mdodo wake Kalebu kadisola, nayo Kalebu kamulava Akisa mwanage muladi yasoligwe na Osinieli. <verse eid="JDG 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 1:14" />Akisa viyafikile kwa Osinieli, kamulongela Osinieli yampule mgunda Kalebu tati yake. Akisa kakala kakwela chihongwe, viyahulumuke, tati yake kamuuza, “Kolonda nikwing'he choni?” <verse eid="JDG 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 1:15" />Kamwidika, “Nitemele mate! Ning'he nzasa za mazi, kwaviya isi youning'hile kuno Negebu ina ng'hangu.” Ivo Kalebu kamwing'ha nzasa zili uchanyha na zili hasi.<verse eid="JDG 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 1:16" />Welesi wa ija Mkeni yakalile mkoi wa chilume wa Musa, kaisondelela na wanhu wa kabila da Yuda kulawa bululu da mitende, yaani bululu da Yeliko, mbaka chuwala cha Yuda uko Negebu habehi na Aladi. Wakala uko hamwe na wanhu wokala muna iisi iyo. <verse eid="JDG 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 1:17" />Wanhu wa kabila da Yuda wahita hamwe na ndugu zawo wa kabila da Simeoni, wawahuma Wakanaani wakalile Sefasi. Wadinanga bululu ijo na wadigalusa zina, waditanga Holima<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Holima fambulo jake kunanga.</char></note>. <verse eid="JDG 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 1:18" />Wanhu wa kabila da Yuda iviya wasola bululu da Gaza na vibululu vake, Ashikeloni na vibululu vake, Ekiloni na vibululu vake. <verse eid="JDG 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 1:19" />Mndewa Mulungu kakala hamwe na wanhu wa kabila da Yuda, nawo waisola isi ya milima mbali hawadahile kuwahuma wakaya wa isi ya bawe, kwaviya wakala na mituka ya ng'hondo itendigwe kwa zuma. <verse eid="JDG 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 1:20" />Kalebu keng'higwa bululu da Hebuloni fana viyalagilize Musa, nayo kaziwinga ng'holo nhatu za Anaki. <verse eid="JDG 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 1:21" />Mbali wanhu wa kabila da Benyamini hawawawingile Wayebusi wowokala bululu da Yelusalemu. Lekamana Wayebusi wokala na wanhu wa kabila da Benyamini mbaka diyelo.<verse eid="JDG 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 1:22" />Makabila ya Efulaimu na Manase wanage Yosefu, wahita kuditowa bululu da Beseli, Mndewa Mulungu kakala hamwe nawo. <verse eid="JDG 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 1:23" />Wawatuma wanhu wahite kudipelemba bululu da Beseli diya umwaka ditangigwa Luzu. <verse eid="JDG 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 1:24" />Wapelembaji wawo wamuwona munhu kolawa muna dibululu ijo, wamulongela, “Chokulamba, chilagusile nzila ya kwingila muna dibululu dino, cheye chizakutendela yanogile.” <verse eid="JDG 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 1:25" />Ivo kawalagusa nzila ya kwingila muna dibululu, nawo wengila na wawakoma wanhu wa bululu diya kwa panga. Mbali hawamkomile munhu iyo na ndugu zake. <verse eid="JDG 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 1:26" />Hamwande munhu iyo kahita kuna iisi ya Wahiti. Uko kazenga bululu na kaditanga Luzu, niijo zina da bululu ijo mbaka diyelo.<verse eid="JDG 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 1:27" />Wanhu wa kabila da Manase hawawawingile wanhu wa Besi Sheani na Taanaki na Doli na Ibileamu na Megido na vibululu vawo vose. Wakanaani wananahila kukala uko. <verse eid="JDG 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 1:28" />Waisilaili viwapatile nguvu hawawawingile Wakanaani, mbali waweng'ha sang'hano za kuwangilizigwa.<verse eid="JDG 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 1:29" />Wanhu wa kabila da Efulaimu hawawawingile Wakanaani wakalile Gezeli, mbali Wakanaani wagendelela kukala uko hamwe nawo.<verse eid="JDG 1:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 1:30" />Wanhu wa kabila da Zabuloni hawawawingile Wakanaani wakalile mabululu ya Kitiloni na Nahalali, mbali wagendelela kukala hamwe nawo kuno wowatendeza sang'hano za kuwangilizigwa.<verse eid="JDG 1:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 1:31" />Wanhu wa kabila da Asheli hawawawingile wanhu wa mabululu ya Ako na Sidoni na Alabu na Akizibu na Heliba na Afeka na Lehobu.<verse eid="JDG 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 1:32" />Wanhu wa kabila da Asheli wakala na Wakanaani weli wakaya wa isi iyo kwaviya hawawawingile.<verse eid="JDG 1:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 1:33" />Wanhu wa kabila da Nafutali hawawawingile wanhu wa mabululu ya Besi Shemeshi na Besi Anasi, mbali wakala hamwe nawo. Hata ivo wakaya wa mabululu yayo walondeka kuwasang'hanila Waisilaili sang'hano za kuwangilizigwa.<verse eid="JDG 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 1:34" />Waamoli wawawinga wanhu wa kabila da Dani kuna iisi ya milima, kwaviya hawawalekele kwiza kukala kuna iisi ya bawe. <verse eid="JDG 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 1:35" />Waamoli wananahila kukala muna yamabululu yeli kuna imilima ya Helesi na Aiyaloni na Shaalibimu. Mbali wanhu wa makabila ya Efulaimu na Manase wawatawala Waamoli na kuwatenda watende sang'hano za kuwangilizigwa.<verse eid="JDG 1:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 1:36" />Mhaka ya Waamoli ikala kasikazi ya Sela kufosela nzila yoyohita muna imilima ya Akilabimu.<verse eid="JDG 1:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JDG 2" />
  <para style="s">Msenga wa kuulanga wa Mndewa Mulungu uko Bokimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 2:1" />Msenga wa kuulanga yoyatumigwe na Mndewa Mulungu kahita kulawa Giligali mbaka Bokimu, kawalongela Waisilaili, “Nimulavani kuna iisi ya Misili na nimgalani muna iisi yoniwalahile kuweng'ha wasaho zenu. Nilonga, ‘Sizabena lagano donikile na mweye ng'o! <verse eid="JDG 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 2:2" />Sekemutende lagano na wanhu wokala muna iisi ino, mbali beneni malupango yawo.’ Mbali hamutendile chiya chinimulongeleni. Habali mutenda vino? <verse eid="JDG 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 2:3" />Lelo nolonga, ‘Sizawawinga kaidi wanhu wokala isi ino, mbali wezakuwa wehi kumwenu na milungu yawo izakuwa mtego kumwenu.’ ” <verse eid="JDG 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 2:4" />Msenga wa Mndewa Mulungu viyakomeleze kuwalongela Waisilaili wose mbuli zino zose, Waisilaili wandusa kulila kwa usungu. <verse eid="JDG 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 2:5" />Hanhu baho wahatanga Bokimu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bokimu fambulo jake kulila kwa usungu.</char></note>. Uko wamulavila nhambiko Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="JDG 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ifa ya Yoshua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 2:6" />Yoshua viyakomeleze kuwalaga Waisilaili, chila munhu kahita hana iisi iyeng'higwe kuwa uhazi wake, muladi yakaisole isi iyo. <verse eid="JDG 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 2:7" />Waisilaili wamsang'hanila Mndewa Mulungu siku zose za ugima wa Yoshua na siku zose za walala waja wakalile wagima viifosile ifa ya Yoshua, waja wawonile sang'hano ng'hulu Mulungu ziyawatendele Waisilaili.<verse eid="JDG 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 2:8" />Yoshua mwana wa Nuni, yeli msang'hani wa Mndewa Mulungu kadanganika na miyaka gana na longo. <verse eid="JDG 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 2:9" />Kawandigwa muna iisi iyeng'higwe itangigwa Timinasi Helesi, kuna iisi ya vilima va Efulaimu, kasikazi ya mulima wa Gaashi.<verse eid="JDG 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 2:10" />Wanhu wose wa ulelo uwo iviya wadanganika. Ulelo usondelele haummanyile Mndewa Mulungu hebu sang'hano ziyawatendele Waisilaili.<verse eid="JDG 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waisilaili womuleka Mndewa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 2:11" />Maabaho Waisilaili watenda mbuli zihile haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu na wandusa kuisang'hanila milungu itangigwa Mabaali. <verse eid="JDG 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 2:12" />Wamuleka Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wa wasaho zawo, ija yawalavile muna iisi ya Misili. Waisondelela na kuitambikila milungu imwenga, milungu yoitambikiligwe na wanhu wakalile mumgwazo yawo. Waitumbalila mavindi milungu iyo na wamtenda Mndewa Mulungu yawone ludoko. <verse eid="JDG 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 2:13" />Wamuleka Mndewa Mulungu na waisang'hanila nyang'hiti za milungu ya Mabaali na Maashitalosi. <verse eid="JDG 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 2:14" />Mndewa Mulungu kawawonela ludoko Waisilaili, ivo kawaleka wahokaji wawahoke vinhu vawo. Kaweka muna yamakono ya wehi wawo, mbaka hawadahile kaidi kuigombela. <verse eid="JDG 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 2:15" />Chila viwahitile kuitowa, mkono wa Mndewa Mulungu uwakwenhukila muladi kuwahuma fana viyalongile na kuilaha. Nawo wawa na usungu mkulu.<verse eid="JDG 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mndewa Mulungu kowasagula wasemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 2:16" />Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kawasagula wasemi wowawakombole kulawa muna yamakono ya wanhu wahokile vinhu vawo. <verse eid="JDG 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 2:17" />Mbali Waisilaili hawawategeleze wasemi wawo, kwaviya wasondelela milungu imwenga fana wagoni na kuitumbalila mavindi. Waleka kuwahiga wasaho zawo wowazindilile malagilizo ya Mndewa Mulungu, wawo hawazindilile malagilizo ya Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="JDG 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 2:18" />Mndewa Mulungu chila viyaweng'hile Waisilaili msemi, yeye mwenyewo kakala hamwe na msemi iyo na kawakombola wanhu kulawa muna yamakono ya wehi wawo siku zose za ugima wa msemi iyo. Mndewa Mulungu kawawonela ubazi kwaviya kahulika chililo chawo chochigaligwa na manhesa yawo na viya viwabamanyigwe. <verse eid="JDG 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 2:19" />Mbali msemi yahadanganika wabwelela ugenzi wawo wa umwaka, wakala vihile kufosa wasaho zawo. Waisondelela milungu imwenga na waisang'hanila na waitumbalila mavindi, hawalekile sang'hano zawo zihile hebu udala wawo. <verse eid="JDG 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 2:20" />Ivo Mndewa Mulungu kawehila Waisilaili, kalonga, “Kwaviya wanhu wano wabena lagano donitendile na wasaho zawo, waleka kutegeleza dizi jangu, <verse eid="JDG 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 2:21" />sizayawinga wanhu wamwenga yawasigazile Yoshua viyadanganike. <verse eid="JDG 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 2:22" />Nizawasang'hanila wanhu wawo kuwageza Waisilaili nilole fana wezaibwelela nzila yangu fana wasaho zawo hebu hawezaibwelela.” <verse eid="JDG 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 2:23" />Ivo Mndewa Mulungu kawaleka wanhu wa zisi izo, hawawingile hebu hawagumile muna yamakono ya Yoshua.<verse eid="JDG 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JDG 3" />
  <para style="s">Zisi zisigale Kanaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 3:1" />Mndewa Mulungu kawatenda wanhu wa zisi zino wasigale muladi kuwageza Waisilaili wakalile hawaitowile ng'hondo muna iisi ya Kanaani. <verse eid="JDG 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 3:2" />Katenda vino muladi kuwafunza wanhu wa welesi wa Waisilaili kuitowa ng'hondo kwaviya wakala hawanawona ng'hondo. <verse eid="JDG 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 3:3" />Wasigale muna iisi wakala wakulu watano wa Wafilisiti, Wakanaani wose na Wasidoni na Wahivi wowakalile muna imilima ya Lebanoni kulawa mulima wa Baali Helimoni mbaka kufika Hamasi.<verse eid="JDG 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 3:4" />Mndewa Mulungu kawaleka wawo muladi yawageze Waisilaili fana wozindilila malagilizo yake, yoyaweng'hile wasaho zawo kwa mkono wa Musa. <verse eid="JDG 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 3:5" />Ivo Waisilaili wakala hamwe na Wakanaani na Wahiti na Waamoli na Wapelizi na Wahivi na Wayebusi. <verse eid="JDG 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 3:6" />Wabwanga wa Waisilaili wawasola wandele wa zisi izo na Waisilaili wawaleka wandele wawo wasoligwe na wabwanga wa zisi izo. Kwa ichimu icho Waisilaili waisang'hanila milungu ya chigeni.<verse eid="JDG 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Osinieli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 3:7" />Waisilaili watenda wihi haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu, wamzimiza Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wawo na wawasang'hanila Mabaali na Maashela. <verse eid="JDG 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 3:8" />Ivo Mndewa Mulungu kawawonela ludoko Waisilaili na kawaguma muna yamakono ya Kushani Lishataimu mfalume wa kasikazi ya Shamu, nawo wamsang'hanila kwa miyaka minane. <verse eid="JDG 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 3:9" />Maabaho Waisilaili viwamulilile Mndewa Mulungu, kawagalila munhu wa kuwakombola, niiyo Osinieli, mwana wa chilume wa Kenazi yeli mdodo wake Kalebu. <verse eid="JDG 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 3:10" />Muhe wa Mndewa Mulungu umwizila, nayo kawa msemi wa Waisilaili. Kahita kuna ing'hondo na Mndewa Mulungu kamguma Kushani Lishataimu muna yamakono yake nayo kamuhuma. <verse eid="JDG 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 3:11" />Ivo isi iyo ikala na tindiwalo kwa miyaka malongo mane, mbaka viyadanganike Osinieli.<verse eid="JDG 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ehudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 3:12" />Waisilaili watenda wihi kaidi haulongozi ha Mndewa Mulungu. Ivo Mndewa Mulungu kamtenda mfalume Egiloni wa Moabu yawatowe Waisilaili, kwaviya watenda wihi haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="JDG 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 3:13" />Egiloni kawaduganya Waamoni na Waamaleki, kahita kuitowa na Waisilaili na kawahuma. Kadisola Bululu da Mitende, niiyo Yeliko. <verse eid="JDG 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 3:14" />Waisilaili wamsang'hanila Egiloni mfalume wa Moabu miyaka longo na minane.<verse eid="JDG 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 3:15" />Waisilaili viwamulilile Mndewa Mulungu, kawagalila munhu wa kuwakombola, niiyo Ehudi mwana wa chilume wa Gela wa kabila da Benyamini, yosang'hanila mkono wa kumoso. Waisilaili wamgalila chitumetume Egiloni mfalume wa Moabu kufosela mumkono wa Ehudi. <verse eid="JDG 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 3:16" />Ehudi kaitendela panga dikutwa banzi mbili, utali wake sentimita malongo matano. Kadifunga muna ichigudi chake ubanzi wa kulume mgati ya mawalo yake. <verse eid="JDG 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 3:17" />Maabaho kamgalila Egiloni mfalume wa Moabu vitumetume viya. Egiloni kakala munhu yanenehe ng'hani. <verse eid="JDG 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 3:18" />Ehudi viyamwing'hile chitumetume, kawalongela wanhu wapapile ivitumetume wasegele. <verse eid="JDG 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 3:19" />Mbali viyafikile kuna zinyang'hiti za mabwe yasongoligwe habehi na Giligali, kambwelela Egiloni, kalonga, “Weye mfalume, nina usenga wa chinyele wa kukulongela.” Ivo mfalume kawalongela wasang'hani wake, “Chilekeni chiidumwe!” Wanhu wose wakalile wokwima habehi yake walawa kunze. <verse eid="JDG 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 3:20" />Maabaho Ehudi kamkwenhukila haja hayakalile yaidumwe muna ichiheleto chake cha uchanyha chili na mbeho, kamulongela, “Nina usenga wako kulawa kwa Mulungu.” Mfalume kenuka muna ichigoda kema wima. <verse eid="JDG 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 3:21" />Ehudi kasomola panga jake kwa mkono wake wa kumoso kulawa ubanzi wa kulume na kamuhoma najo mfalume muna umunda. <verse eid="JDG 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 3:22" />Panga jose dingila mgati hamwe na muhini wake. Mavuta yadigubika panga ijo kwaviya Ehudi hadilavile, dilawilila ubanzi umwenga. <verse eid="JDG 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 3:23" />Maabaho Ehudi kalawa kunze na kahinda kwa kufuli zinyivi za chiheleto icho cha uchanyha.<verse eid="JDG 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 3:24" />Viyasegele, wasang'hani wa mfalume wabwela. Viwawonile nyivi zose zihindigwa, wagesa kahita mwanza umo mgati ya ichiheleto. <verse eid="JDG 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 3:25" />Wagozela mbaka wengilwa na ludumbo. Viwawonile havugula, wasola luvugulo na wavugula ulwivi. Wamuwona mfalume wawo hasi, kadanganika.<verse eid="JDG 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 3:26" />Viwakalile wogozela, Ehudi kawabanga kafosela kuna zinyang'hiti za mabwe, kahita Seila. <verse eid="JDG 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 3:27" />Viyafikile kuna iisi ya vilima va Efulaimu katowa mhalati, Waisilaili wahulumuka hamwe nayo kulawa kuna imilima na kawalanguliza. <verse eid="JDG 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 3:28" />Kawalongela, “Nisondeleleni, kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kawaguma wehi wenu Wamoabu muna yamakono yenu.” Ivo wamsondelela mbaka hana ichiloko cha Yoludani na kuchisola kulawa muna yamakono ya Wamoabu, wakimilila munhu yoyose sekeyafose. <verse eid="JDG 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 3:29" />Siku iyo wawakoma Wamoabu walume 10,000, wose wakala watelele na wana nguvu, hasigale hata munhu imwe. <verse eid="JDG 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 3:30" />Ivo Waisilaili wawahuma Wamoabu. Isi ihola miyaka malongo manane.<verse eid="JDG 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shamgali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 3:31" />Viyakomeleze Ehudi keza Shamgali mwana wa chilume wa Anasi, ija yawakomile Wafilisiti magana sita kwa balati da kudimila ng'ombe. Nayo iviya kawakombola Waisilaili.<verse eid="JDG 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JDG 4" />
  <para style="s">Debola na Balaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 4:1" />Ehudi viyadanganike, Waisilaili watenda wihi kaidi haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="JDG 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 4:2" />Ivo Mndewa Mulungu kawaguma muna yamakono ya Yabini, mfalume wa Kanaani, yoyatawale uko Hazoli. Mkulu wa wakalizi wake kakala Sisela, ija yakalile kokala Haloshesi Hagoimu. <verse eid="JDG 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 4:3" />Maabaho Waisilaili wamulilila Mndewa Mulungu, kwaviya kakala na mituka ya ng'hondo magana kenda yoitendigwe kwa zuma, kawagaza Waisilaili kwa miyaka malongo maidi.<verse eid="JDG 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 4:4" />Lelo Debola yeli mulotezi wa chike, muke wa Lapidosi, niiyo yakalile msemi wa Isilaili chipindi icho. <verse eid="JDG 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 4:5" />Kakala hasi ya mtende wa Debola woukalile hagati ya Lama na Beseli kuna iisi ya vilima va Efulaimu. Waisilaili wamwizila muladi yahumize mbuli yawo. <verse eid="JDG 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 4:6" />Siku dimwe Debola kamtanga Balaka mwana wa chilume wa Abinoamu kulawa bululu da Kedeshi dili uko Nafutali, kamulongela, “Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wa Isilaili, kokulagiliza, ‘Hita ukasole wanhu wako kuna umulima wa Taboli, sagula walume 10,000 kulawa wanhu wa Nafutali na wanhu wa Zabuloni. <verse eid="JDG 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 4:7" />Niye nizamsongeza Sisela, mkulu wa wakalizi wa Yabini, yeze na wakalizi na mituka yake kuitowa na weye kuna ulwanda lwa Kishoni, mbali nizakutenda umuhume.’ ”<verse eid="JDG 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 4:8" />Balaka kamulongela Debola, “One uhahita hamwe na niye, nizahita, mbali one huhitile hamwe na niye, sizahita.” <verse eid="JDG 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 4:9" />Debola kamwidika, “Ona, nizahita hamwe na weye, mbali hwizapata hishima yoyose ya uhumi, kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kezamguma Sisela muna yamakono ya mwanamke.” Ivo Debola kaisondelela na Balaka kuhita Kedeshi. <verse eid="JDG 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 4:10" />Balaka kayatanga makabila ya Nafutali na Zabuloni uko Kedeshi, wanhu 10,000 wamsondelela. Debola kahita hamwe nayo.<verse eid="JDG 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 4:11" />Chipindi icho, Hebeli yeli Mkeni, kakala kaibagula na Wakeni wayage weli welekwa wa Hobabu, mkoi wa chilume wa Musa, keka hema jake habehi ya mwaloni wa Zaananimu uli habehi na Kedeshi.<verse eid="JDG 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 4:12" />Viwamulongele Sisela kuwa Balaka mwana wa chilume wa Abinoamu kakwela kuna umulima wa Taboli, <verse eid="JDG 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 4:13" />Sisela kaiduganya hamwe mituka yake yose magana kenda na walume wose hamwe nayo, kulawa Haloshesi Hagoimu mbaka lwanda lwa Kishoni. <verse eid="JDG 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 4:14" />Maabaho Debola kamulongela Balaka, “Hita! Diyelo Mndewa Mulungu kezamguma Sisela muna yamakono yako. Mndewa Mulungu kokulongolela.” Ivo Balaka kahulumuka kuna umulima wa Taboli kawalanguliza wanhu 10,000. <verse eid="JDG 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 4:15" />Balaka kaitowa, nayo Mndewa Mulungu kawatenda Sisela na wakalizi wake wose wakimbile haulongozi wa Balaka kwa panga. Sisela kalawa muna ditololi jake kakimbila kwa migulu. <verse eid="JDG 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 4:16" />Mbali Balaka kawasondelela wakalizi na mituka mbaka Haloshesi Hagoimu na kuwakoma wakalizi wose wa Sisela kwa panga. Hasigale hata munhu imwe. <verse eid="JDG 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 4:17" />Mbali Sisela kakimbila kwa migulu mbaka kuna dihema da Yaeli, muke wa Hebeli, Mkeni. Katenda ivo kwaviya kukala na tindiwalo hagati ya mfalume Yabini wa Hazoli na ndugu wa Hebeli. <verse eid="JDG 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 4:18" />Yaeli kalawa kumuhokela Sisela, kamulongela, “Mwenevale wangu, kalibu kumwangu hebu sekeudumbe.” Ivo kengila muna dihema jake, nayo kamgubika na golole dizamile ng'hani.<verse eid="JDG 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 4:19" />Sisela kamulongela Yaeli, “Ning'he mazi ning'we kwaviya ng'hilu yoluma.” Kagubula mfuko wa mbende wa maziwa na kamwing'ha yang'we, maabaho kamgubika kaidi.<verse eid="JDG 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 4:20" />Sisela kamulongela, “Ima hana ulwivi lwa hema. Munhu yoyose yahakuuza, ‘Hano hana munhu yoyose?’ Longa ‘Habule.’ ” <verse eid="JDG 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 4:21" />Sisela kakala yagonile ng'hani kwa ulegevu. Ivo Yaeli yeli muke wa Hebeli, kasola chigingi cha hema na nyundo, kamuhitila ugaluga na kachigongoma ichigingi chiya muna iditwi jake, chingila mbaka muna iisi. Ivo Sisela kadanganika bahobaho. <verse eid="JDG 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 4:22" />Nayo Balaka viyakalile komsondelela Sisela, Yaeli kalawa kunze kumuhokela, kamulongela, “Izo! Nizakulagusa munhu ija youmzahila.” Balaka kengila muna dihema da Yaeli na umo kamfika Sisela kadanganika, na chigingi cha hema muna iditwi jake.<verse eid="JDG 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 4:23" />Siku iyo Mndewa Mulungu kawatenda Waisilaili wamuhume Yabini mfalume wa Kanaani. <verse eid="JDG 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 4:24" />Waisilaili waiyoha ng'hani kumtowa Yabini mfalume wa Kanaani mbaka viwamnangile.<verse eid="JDG 4:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JDG 5" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa Debola na Balaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 5:1" />Siku iyo Debola na Balaka mwana wa chilume wa Abinoamu wemba wila uno,<verse eid="JDG 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 5:2" />“Walangulizi wa Isilaili viwawalongoze wanhu kuhita kuna ing'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:2">wanhu viwailavile wawo wenyewo kuna ing'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:2">mtogozeni Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="JDG 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 5:3" />Tegelezeni mweye wafalume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:3">hulikeni mweye watawala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:3">nizamwimbila Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:3">nizamtowela lukenze Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wa Isilaili.<verse eid="JDG 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 5:4" />“Weye Mndewa Mulungu, viulawile uko Seili kowakala Waedomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:4">viuhitile kuna ing'hondo kulawa kuna iisi ya Edomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:4">isi igudemeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:4">ulanga ulagaza mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:4">ona, mawingu yatonya mvula.<verse eid="JDG 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 5:5" />Milima itingisika haulongozi hako Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wa Sinai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:5">haulongozi hako Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wa Isilaili.<verse eid="JDG 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 5:6" />“Muna zisiku za Shamgali mwana wa chilume wa Anasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:6">muna ichipindi cha Yaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:6">wanhu waleka kufosa muna zinzila ng'hulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:6">wafosela nzila za mumgwazo.<verse eid="JDG 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 5:7" />Walimi waleka kulima uko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:7">waleka kulima uko Isilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:7">mbaka vinilawilile niye Debola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:7">mama muna Isilaili.<verse eid="JDG 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 5:8" />Viwasagule milungu ya imwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:8">ng'hondo ingila muna ulwivi lukulu lwa bululu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:8">Mbali hapatike munhu yeli na panga hebu ngao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:8">hagati ya wanhu 40,000 wa Isilaili.<verse eid="JDG 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 5:9" />Moyo wangu wahamwe na walangulizi wa Isilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:9">wahamwe na wanhu wowailavile wenyewo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:9">Mtogozeni Mndewa Mulungu!<verse eid="JDG 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 5:10" />“Geseni mbuli ino, mweye wakwelavihongwe wazelu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:10">mweye womkala mchanyha ya vihongwe na malili yanogile ng'hani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:10">Geseni mweye womugenda muna inzila.<verse eid="JDG 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 5:11" />Tegelezeni wokwimba muna ivisima va mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:11">wogong'onda sang'hano zinogile za Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:11">sang'hano zinogile za wanhu wa Mndewa Mulungu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:11">Maabaho wanhu wa Mndewa Mulungu wahita kuna ulwivi lukulu lwa bululu.<verse eid="JDG 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 5:12" />‘Lamka, lamka, Debola!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:12">Lamka, lamka wimbe wila!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:12">Lamka Balaka mwana wa Abinoamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:12">uwasole wanhu wasoligwe kuing'hondo.’<verse eid="JDG 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 5:13" />Maabaho watowang'hondo wasigale wagima wawahitila walangulizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:13">waja wanhu wa Mndewa Mulungu wanizila niye Debola.<verse eid="JDG 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 5:14" />Kulawa Efulaimu wahulumuka kuna dikolongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:14">wasondelela ndugu zawo wanhu wa Benyamini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:14">wahulumuka walangulizi kulawa Makili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:14">wahulumuka kulawa Zabuloni waja wokwamha fimbo za walangulizi.<verse eid="JDG 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 5:15" />Wakulu wa Isakali waisondelela na Debola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:15">wanhu wa Isakali wakala na Balaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:15">wamsondelela kwa kukimbila mbaka kuna dikolongo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:15">Mbali ng'holo zimwenga muna zing'holo za Lubeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:15">wakala wosinhasinha ng'hani muna umoyo.<verse eid="JDG 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 5:16" />Wanhu wa kabila da Lubeni, habali musigala muna ivikwama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:16">kutegeleza miluzi yoitowigwa kuwatanga wanyama?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:16">Muna zing'holo za Lubeni wakala wosinhasinha kwiza.<verse eid="JDG 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 5:17" />Kabila da Gadi disigala kuumwambu wa lwanda lwa Yoludani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:17">na kabila da Dani, habali wasigala muna ingalawa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:17">Kabila da Asheli disigala uko mhwani ya bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:17">dikala kuna ibandali yake.<verse eid="JDG 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 5:18" />Mbali wanhu wa Zabuloni wauhonza ugima wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:18">wanhu wa Nafutali wauhonza ugima wawo kuna ing'hondo.<verse eid="JDG 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 5:19" />“Wafalume weza na waitowa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:19">wafalume wa Kanaani waitowa uko Taanaki habehi na nzasa za Megido,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:19">hawasolile chinhu chochose kulawa kuing'hondo.<verse eid="JDG 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 5:20" />Nhondo ziitowa kwa ubanzi wa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:20">kulawa kuulanga, ziitowa na Sisela.<verse eid="JDG 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 5:21" />Lwanda lwa Kishoni luwakulula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:21">gombo kulu da lwanda Kishoni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:21">Weye muhe wangu gendelela kuulongozi kwa nguvu!<verse eid="JDG 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 5:22" />Maabaho vihongwe weza kuwabojoga kwa sindo ng'hulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:22">wabojoga isi kwa nguvu mizayo yawo.<verse eid="JDG 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 5:23" />Msenga wa Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:23">‘Duwileni Melosi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:23">waduwileni kwa usungu wanhu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:23">kwaviya hawezile kumtaza Mndewa Mulungu, kwa kuitowa na wanhu weli na nguvu.’<verse eid="JDG 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 5:24" />“Yaeli yatemeligwe mate kufosa wanaake wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:24">muke wa Hebeli Mkeni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:24">Kezatemeligwa mate kufosa wanaake wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:24">wokala muna yamahema.<verse eid="JDG 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 5:25" />Kapula mazi, mbali kamwing'ha maziwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:25">kamwing'ha maziwa muna dihamha da hishima.<verse eid="JDG 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 5:26" />Kagolosa mkono wake kumoso kamha chigingi cha hema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:26">mkono wake wa kulume kamha nyundo ya fundi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:26">kumduluga Sisela muna iditwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:26">kamuhoma muna imhalagutwi.<verse eid="JDG 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 5:27" />Sisela kaidulika kagwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:27">katambalala hupi muna yamagulu yake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:27">Haja hayaidulike kagwa na bahobaho kadanganika.<verse eid="JDG 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 5:28" />“Mami yake Sisela kalola kuna dizonzo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:28">kasungulila na kalila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:28">‘Habali tololi jake ukalama kufika?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:28">Habali misindo ya mituka yake haihulikike?’<verse eid="JDG 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 5:29" />Wanaake wabala wamwidika na kailongela mwenyewo muumoyo,<verse eid="JDG 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 5:30" />‘Vino hawapatile mateka na kuyagola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:30">mndele imwe hebu waidi kwa chila munhu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:30">Walo da langi kwa ichimu cha Sisela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:30">walo dinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:30">mawalo yanogile kwa ichimu changu cha kuiyawala.’<verse eid="JDG 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 5:31" />“Mndewa Mulungu, wehi wako wose wanangigwe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:31">Mbali mbwiya zako wawe fana zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:31">vidilawa na nguvu yake.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 5:31">Isi iwa na tindiwalo kwa miyaka malongo mane.<verse eid="JDG 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JDG 6" />
  <para style="s">Gideoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 6:1" />Waisilaili watenda wihi haulongozi ha Mndewa Mulungu, ivo Mndewa Mulungu kaweka muna yamakono ya Wamidiani kwa miyaka saba. <verse eid="JDG 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 6:2" />Wamidiani wakala na nguvu kufosa Waisilaili, ivo Waisilaili waitendela hanhu ha kuifisa kuna imilima na kuna yamatuka na kuna zimhongono. <verse eid="JDG 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 6:3" />Siku zose Waisilaili viwahandile mbeyu muna imigunda, Wamidiani na Waamaleki na wanhu wamwenga wokala ubanzi wa ulawilo wa zuwa weza kuwatowa. <verse eid="JDG 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 6:4" />Weka malago muna iisi yawo na kubananga vinhu vose vihandigwe muna iisi iyo mbaka Gaza. Hawawalekele Waisilaili chochose, yawe ng'hondolo hebu ng'ombe hebu mhunda. <verse eid="JDG 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 6:5" />Wehi wezaga wengi fana nzige, hamwe na ng'ombe wawo na mahema yawo, iviya wawo na ngamiya wawo wakala wengi ng'hani. Wengila muna iisi iyo muladi wainange. <verse eid="JDG 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 6:6" />Waisilaili watendigwa kuwa ngayengaye kwa ichimu cha Wamidiani mbaka wamulilila Mndewa Mulungu yawataze.<verse eid="JDG 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 6:7" />Waisilaili viwamulilile Mndewa Mulungu yawataze kwa ichimu cha Wamidiani, <verse eid="JDG 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 6:8" />Mndewa Mulungu kamtuma mulotezi kwa Waisilaili, kawalongela, “Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wa Isilaili, kolonga, ‘Nimulavani kuna iisi ya Misili komukalile watumwa. <verse eid="JDG 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 6:9" />Nimkombolani muna yamakono ya Wamisili wose na waja wamgazileni. Niwawinga wanhu haulongozi wenu na nimwing'hani isi yawo. <verse eid="JDG 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 6:10" />Maabaho nimulongelani, “Niye niiyo Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wenu, sekemuisang'hanile milungu ya Waamoli, waja muwasolele isi yawo.” Mbali hamuhulike dizi jangu.’ ”<verse eid="JDG 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gideoni kotangigwa na Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 6:11" />Msenga wa Mndewa Mulungu kahita, kakala hasi ya mwaloni wa Yoashi, Mwabiezeli, uko Afula. Gideoni mwana wa Yoashi kakala kohulula ngano mgati ya hanhu ha kukamila zabibu muladi Wamidiani sekewamuwone. <verse eid="JDG 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 6:12" />Msenga wa Mndewa Mulungu kamulawilila, kamulongela, “Mndewa Mulungu kahamwe na weye, weye uli galu.”<verse eid="JDG 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 6:13" />Gideoni kamulongela, “Weye mndewa wangu, one Mndewa Mulungu yahawa hamwe na cheye, habali mbuli zino zose zochipata? Zakulihi sang'hano zako za mwazanyo zowachisimulile wasaho zetu, walonga, ‘Mndewa Mulungu niiyo yachilavile kuna iisi ya Misili.’ Mbali sambi Mndewa Mulungu kachileka na kachika muna yamakono ya Wamidiani.”<verse eid="JDG 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 6:14" />Mndewa Mulungu kamuhindukila, kamulongela, “Hita kwa udahi wouli nawo, ukawakombole Waisilaili kulawa muna yamakono ya Wamidiani. Niye nokutuma.”<verse eid="JDG 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 6:15" />Gideoni kedika, “Mndewa, nizadahaze kuikombola Isilaili? Lukolo lwangu ni lunyondenyonde muna dikabila da Manase, niye ni munhu mdodo ng'hani muna ikaye yangu.”<verse eid="JDG 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 6:16" />Mndewa Mulungu kamwidika, “Nizakuwa hamwe na weye, ivo kwizadaha kuwatowa Wamidiani wose fana komtowa munhu imwe.”<verse eid="JDG 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 6:17" />Gideoni kedika, “One uhaninogela, nilaguse kuwa kweli weye iyo youlonga na niye. <verse eid="JDG 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 6:18" />Nokulamba sekeusegele hano mbaka vondanibwele na kukugalila chitumetume.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 6:18">Mndewa Mulungu kalonga, “Nizakala mbaka vondaubwele.”<verse eid="JDG 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 6:19" />Gideoni kahita ukaye yake kasasala mwanaluti na gate hadigumigwe lusu kulawa muna didebe da usage. Kaguma nyama muna ichisege na msuzi muna inongo, maabaho kamgalila hasi ya mwaloni, kamwing'ha.<verse eid="JDG 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 6:20" />Msenga wa Mulungu kalonga, “Sola nyama na gate hadinagumigwa lusu, vike muna uluwe na gida umsuzi.” Na Gideoni katenda ivo. <verse eid="JDG 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 6:21" />Maabaho msenga wa Mndewa Mulungu kagolosa fimbo yake, kadalisa nyama na magate kwa fimbo yake. Moto ulawa kuna uluwe na kulunguza nyama na gate. Maabaho msenga wa kuulanga kasegela.<verse eid="JDG 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 6:22" />Baho Gideoni kavimanya kuwa iyo kakala msenga wa Mndewa Mulungu, kalonga, “Nizagaya, weye Mndewa Mulungu, kwaviya nimuwona msenga wako chihanga kwa chihanga.” <verse eid="JDG 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 6:23" />Mbali Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela, “Tindiwalo diwe na weye! Sekeudumbe hwizadanganika.” <verse eid="JDG 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 6:24" />Gideoni kamzengela Mndewa Mulungu lupango na kalutanga, “Mndewa Mulungu ni tindiwalo.” Mbaka diyelo lupango ulo lwauko Afula bululu da Wabiezeli. <verse eid="JDG 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 6:25" />Ichilo icho Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Gideoni, “Sola ng'ombe lume da tati yako dekaidi dili na miyaka saba, ukabomole lupango lwa Baali luyelinalo tati yako na ubene nyang'hiti ya Ashela ili habehi na baho. <verse eid="JDG 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 6:26" />Maabaho unizengele niye Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wako, lupango loulondeka uchanyha ya mhongono ino. Maabaho unilavile nhambiko ya kutimbula ya ng'ombe diya dilume dekaidi. Usang'hanile ngodi za nyang'hiti za Ashela youibenile.” <verse eid="JDG 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 6:27" />Basi Gideoni kasola wasang'hani wake longo na katenda fana Mndewa Mulungu viyamulongele. Mbali kwaviya kadumba ndugu zake na wanhu wa muna dibululu badala ya kutenda mbuli izo imisi, katenda ichilo. <verse eid="JDG 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 6:28" />Wanhu wa muna dibululu viwalamkile imitondo ng'hani, wawona lupango lwa Baali na nyang'hiti ya Ashela ikalile habehi na baho vibenigwa. Ng'ombe lume dekaidi ditimbuligwa uchanyha ya lupango luzengigwe baho. <verse eid="JDG 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 6:29" />Waiuza wawo kwa wawo, “Yelihi yatendile mbuli ino?” Wachunguza na watola kuwa Gideoni mwana wa Yoashi katenda mbuli ino. <verse eid="JDG 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 6:30" />Maabaho walume wa bululu wamulongela Yoashi, “Mgale mwanago hano muladi yakomigwe! Kabananga lupango lwa Baali na kabomola nyang'hiti ya Asheli yoikalile hamwe nayo.” <verse eid="JDG 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 6:31" />Mbali Yoashi kawalongela wanhu wose wakalile woihuma nayo, “Vino mweye mwizamgombela Baali? Hebu mwizamkombola? Munhu yoyose yomgombela kezakomigwa ing'hali hainafika imitondo! One Baali yahawa mulungu, kodaha koigombela mwenyewo munhu yahabena lupango lwake.” <verse eid="JDG 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 6:32" />Ivo kwandusila siku ijo wamtanga Gideoni “Yelubaali” fambulo jake, “Baali nayaigombele mwenyewo”, kwaviya kabomola lupango lwa Baali. <verse eid="JDG 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 6:33" />Maabaho Wamidiani wose na Waamaleki na wanhu wa makabila ya ulawilo wa zuwa waiting'hana. Waloka lwanda lwa Yoludani na weka lago kuna dikolongo da Yezileeli. <verse eid="JDG 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 6:34" />Mbali muhe wa Mndewa Mulungu umwizila Gideoni, nayo katowa mhalati kuwatanga Wabiezeli muladi wamsondelele. <verse eid="JDG 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 6:35" />Kawatuma wasenga muna isi yose ya Manase weze kumsondelela. Kawatuma wasenga wamwenga wakawatange wanhu wa makabila ya Asheli, Zabuloni na Nafutali, nawo weza kuilumba nayo.<verse eid="JDG 6:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 6:36" />Maabaho Gideoni kamulongela Mulungu, “One uhaikombola Isilaili kwa mkono wangu fana viulongile, <verse eid="JDG 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 6:37" />nizakwika mbende ya ng'hondolo uchanyha ya sakafu ya kuhwagila uhemba. One kuhawa na nungwe muna imbende muhala, sakafu ihanyala, basi nizavimanya kuwa kwizaikombola Isilaili kwa mkono wangu, fana viulongile.” <verse eid="JDG 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 6:38" />Vino ivo voilawilile. Gideoni viyalamkile igolo yake imitondo ng'hani, kakama nhungwe yoikalile uchanyha ya ija imbende, kamemeza hamha. <verse eid="JDG 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 6:39" />Maabaho Gideoni kamulongela Mulungu, “Sekeuniwonele ludoko, nileke nilonge mwanza umwenga. Nileke niigeze kaidi mbende ino. Nokulamba uchanyha ya mbende kunyale, mbali hasi hawe na nhungwe.” <verse eid="JDG 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 6:40" />Ichilo icho Mulungu katenda ivo. Mbende ija ikala inyalile, iviya nhungwe ikala hana iisi muhala.<verse eid="JDG 6:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JDG 7" />
  <para style="s">Gideoni kowahuma Wamidiani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 7:1" />Siku dimwe Yelubaali, niiyo Gideoni, hamwe na wanhu wake wose walamka na weka lago jawo habehi na nzasa ya Halodi. Lago da Wamidiani dikala kasikazi kuna dikolongo da mulima Mole.<verse eid="JDG 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 7:2" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Gideoni, “Wanhu wouli nawo ni wengi ng'hani kumwangu kuwaguma Wamidiani muna yamakono yawo. Waisilaili sekewaitogoze haulongozi wangu na kulonga kuwa waikombola kwa nguvu zawo wenyewo. <verse eid="JDG 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 7:3" />Lelo wagong'ondele wanhu wose kuwa munhu yoyose yeli moga hebu yogudema yasegele kuna umulima wa Gileadi yabwele ukaye yake.” Ivo wanhu 22,000 wabwela ukaye, wanhu 10,000 wasigala.<verse eid="JDG 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 7:4" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Gideoni, “Wanhu wawo wang'hali wengi ng'hani. Lelo wagale kuna ulwanda, niye nizawageza uko. Munhu yoyose yondanikulongele, ‘Ino kezahita na weye,’ nayahite. Mbali munhu yoyose yondanimulongele, ‘hezahita na weye,’ iyo sekeyahite na weye.” <verse eid="JDG 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 7:5" />Gideoni kawagala wanhu kuna yamazi. Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Gideoni, “Chila munhu yondayalambite mazi yano kwa lulimi lwake fana imbwa viyolambita, kwizambagula, iviya kwizambagula munhu yotumbala mavindi kung'wa mazi.”<verse eid="JDG 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 7:6" />Wanhu wang'wile mazi kulawa muna yamakono yawo kwa kulambita fana imbwa wakala 300. Mbali wamwenga wose wasigalile watumbala mavindi kung'wa mazi. <verse eid="JDG 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 7:7" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Gideoni, “Kwa wanhu wawo 300 wang'wile kwa kulambita fana imbwa, nizawakombola Waisilaili na kuwaguma Wamidiani muna yamakono yawo. Wamwenga wose wabwele kumwawo.” <verse eid="JDG 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 7:8" />Wanhu waja wasola ndiya zawo muna yamakono na mhalati zawo, Gideoni kawatuma wanhu wose wa Isilaili, chila imwe muna dihema jake. Kawakimilila wanhu waja 300, na lago da Wamidiani dikala hasi yake kuna dikolongo.<verse eid="JDG 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 7:9" />Ichilo icho Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Gideoni, “Hita ukawatowe muna dilago jawo, kwaviya niweka muna yamakono yako. <verse eid="JDG 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 7:10" />Mbali one uhadumba, hita hamwe na Pula msang'hani wako. <verse eid="JDG 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 7:11" />Kwizahulika chiwolonga, maabaho makono yako yezagumigwa nguvu, uhite kuna dilago.” Ivo Gideoni na Pula msang'hani wake wahita mbaka kumgwazo wa dilago da wehi. <verse eid="JDG 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 7:12" />Wamidiani na Waamaleki na wanhu wose wa ulawilo wa zuwa wakala kuna dikolongo, wengi fana nzige na ngamiya wawo hawapeteka, wengi fana msanga wa mhwani. <verse eid="JDG 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 7:13" />Gideoni viyafikile kamuhulika munhu imwe komsimulila miyage nzozi vino, “Nilota nzozi. Niwona gate da shayili dobimbilika mbaka kuna dilago da Wamidiani kutowa hema na kudihindula hasi uchanyha. Hema dibiduka na digona hasi.” <verse eid="JDG 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 7:14" />Miyage kamwidika, “Iyo yolagusa upanga wa Muisilaili ija Gideoni mwana wa Yoashi iyo muna yamakono yake Mulungu kaweka Wamidiani na jeshi jose.”<verse eid="JDG 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 7:15" />Gideoni viyahulike simulizi izo za nzozi na fambulo jake, katumbala mavindi kamtambikila Mndewa Mulungu. Maabaho kabwela kuna dilago da Waisilaili kalonga, “Lamkeni chihite, kwaviya Mulungu kadika jeshi da Wamidiani muna yamakono yenu.” <verse eid="JDG 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 7:16" />Ivo kawagola wanhu waja 300 muna yamabumbila matatu, kaweng'ha mhalati na vimbazi na viwenge mgati. <verse eid="JDG 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 7:17" />Kawalongela, “Munilole na mutende fana vondanitende chipindi vondanifike muna dilago. <verse eid="JDG 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 7:18" />Niye na wanhu wose weli hamwe na niye vondachitowe mhalati, mweye wose toweni mhalati kulawa chila ubanzi na kulandula dizi, ‘Kwa ichimu cha Mndewa Mulungu na kwa ichimu cha Gideoni!’ ”<verse eid="JDG 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 7:19" />Gideoni na wanhu waja 100 woyakalile hamwe nawo, wafika kuuhelelo wa dilago, mwanduso wa zamu ya ichilo ng'hani, viwasakanye wakalizi. Watowa mhalati na watula vimbazi vikalile muna yamakono yawo. <verse eid="JDG 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 7:20" />Mabumbila yose matatu watowa mhalati kutula vimbazi vawo. Muna yamakono yawo ya kumoso wamha milenge kwa makono yawo ya kulume wamha mhalati kuzitowa, kuno wolonga kwa dizi kulu, “Upanga kwa ichimu cha Mndewa Mulungu kwa ichimu cha Gideoni!” <verse eid="JDG 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 7:21" />Chila munhu kema hanhu hake kudizunguluka dilago. Watowang'hondo wose wa wehi wapwilika kuno woguta ng'hondo. <verse eid="JDG 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 7:22" />Viwatowile mhalati zawo, Mndewa Mulungu kawatenda wehi waikanhe na upanga wawo wenyewo. Wakimbilila uko Besi Shita, kugendelela Selela, mbaka kuna imhaka ya Abeli Mehola, habehi na Tabasi. <verse eid="JDG 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 7:23" />Walume wa Isilaili wakala waiduganya kulawa Nafutali na kulawa Asheli na kulawa isi yose ya Manase, wawakimbilila Wamidiani. <verse eid="JDG 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 7:24" />Gideoni katuma wasenga iisi yose ya vilima va Efulaimu, kalonga, “Hulumukeni kusonhela Wamidiani na mukimilile viloko va mazi haulongozi wawo mbaka Besi Bala na iviya lwanda lwa Yoludani.” Ivo walume wose wa Efulaimu watangigwa, wauzinga lwanda lwa Yoludani mbaka Besi Bala. <verse eid="JDG 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 7:25" />Wawateka walangulizi waidi wa Midiani, yani Olebu na Zeebu. Wamkoma Olebu muna uluwe lwa Olebu, nayo Zeebu wamkoma hanhu ha kukamila zabibu, viwakalile wowakimbilila Wamidiani. Wamgalila Gideoni matwi ya Olebu na Zeebu kuumwambu wa lwanda lwa Yoludani.<verse eid="JDG 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JDG 8" />
  <para style="s">Wamidiani wohumigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 8:1" />Maabaho wanhu wa Efulaimu wamulongela Gideoni, “Habali viuhitile kuna ing'hondo kuitowa na Wamidiani huchitangile? Habali kuchitendela vino?” Wamkalikila ng'hani. <verse eid="JDG 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 8:2" />Mbali Gideoni kawalongela, “Mbuli zonitenda hazifaya one zihalinganyizigwa na ziya zimutendile mweye. Chiwadondola wanhu wa Efulaimu viwamalile kugobola chinogile kufosa chiyagobole ndugu yangu Abiezeli. <verse eid="JDG 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 8:3" />Mulungu kaweka muna yamakono yenu walangulizi wa Midiani, Olebu na Zeebu. Niye nitenda choni nihalinganyizigwa na mweye?” Gideoni viyakomeleze kulonga yayo, ludoko lwawo luhunguka.<verse eid="JDG 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 8:4" />Siku izo Gideoni na wanhu wake magana matatu weza kuna ulwanda lwa Yoludani na waloka. Ingawa wakala walegela ng'hani, wagendelela kuwawinga wehi wawo. <verse eid="JDG 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 8:5" />Ivo kawalongela wanhu wa Sukosi, “Nolamba muweng'he magate wanhu wano wonizile nawo kwaviya walegela ng'hani. Niye nogendelela kuwawinga Zeba na Salimuna weli wafalume wa Midiani.”<verse eid="JDG 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 8:6" />Mbali walangulizi wa Sukosi wamuuza, “Habali chimwing'heni magate ukati mung'hali hamunawahuma Zeba na Salimuna?” <verse eid="JDG 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 8:7" />Gideoni kawalongela, “Vinoga! Mndewa Mulungu vondayaweke Zeba na Salimuna muna yamakono yangu, nizazidega ng'huli zenu kwa miwa na mbigili za muna dibwilingu!” <verse eid="JDG 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 8:8" />Gideoni kahita uko Penueli na kawapula viyaviya. Wanhu wa uko Penueli wamwidika fana viwedike wanhu wa Sukosi. <verse eid="JDG 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 8:9" />Gideoni kawalongela, “Vondanibwele kwa tindiwalo nizabomola lingo dino!”<verse eid="JDG 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 8:10" />Zeba na Salimuna wakala uko Kalikoi na watowang'hondo fana 15,000 wowasigale kulawa kwa watowang'hondo wa ulawilo wa zuwa, kwaviya watowang'hondo 120,000 wadanganika. <verse eid="JDG 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 8:11" />Gideoni kasondelela nzila ya wanhu wokala muna yamahema ili ulawilo wa zuwa wa Noba na Yogibeha, kawatowa watowang'hondo wawo wakalile hawaisasale. <verse eid="JDG 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 8:12" />Wafalume wa Midiani, Zeba na Salimuna waibanga wakimbila, mbali Gideoni kawasondelela, kawagwila na kuwadumbiza watowang'hondo wose.<verse eid="JDG 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 8:13" />Gideoni mwana wa Yoashi viyabwelile kulawa kuna ing'hondo kafosela nzila ya Helesi, <verse eid="JDG 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 8:14" />kamgwila mbwanga yolawa Sukoti na kamuuza, nayo kamwandikila mazina malongo saba na saba ya walangulizi wa Sukosi na walala wa bululu. <verse eid="JDG 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 8:15" />Maabaho kahita kwa wanhu wa Sukosi, kalonga, “Kumbukeni vimulemile kunitaza. Mulonga kuwa hamuweng'ha wanhu wangu walegele ndiya yoyose, kwaviya niye siwahumile Zeba na Salimuna. Vinoga, awano hano!” <verse eid="JDG 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 8:16" />Maabaho kasola miwa na mbigili kulawa muna dibwilingu na kavisang'hanila ivo kwa kuwatagusa walangulizi wa Sukosi. <verse eid="JDG 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 8:17" />Iviya kagwisa lingo da uko Penueli na kuwakoma walume wa bululu diya.<verse eid="JDG 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 8:18" />Maabaho Gideoni kawauza Zeba na Salimuna, “Vilihi wanhu womuwakomile uko Taboli?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 8:18">Wamwidika, “Walinga fana weye, mana walinga fana wana wa mfalume.”<verse eid="JDG 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 8:19" />Gideoni kalonga, “Wawo wakala ndugu zangu, wana wa mami yangu yanyeleke. Noilaha kwa Mndewa Mulungu yeli mgima, one hamuwakomile wawo, na niye sigambenimkomeni.” <verse eid="JDG 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 8:20" />Maabaho kamulongela Yeseli yeli chaudele wake, “Gendelela, wakome wawo!” Mbali imbwanga havutile upanga wake. Kadumba, kwaviya kakala yang'hali mbwanga.<verse eid="JDG 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 8:21" />Maabaho Zeba na Salimuna wamulongela Gideoni, “Gendelela, chikome weye mwenyewo. Ino ni sang'hano ya munhu mkulu.” Gideoni kawakoma yeye mwenyewo na kusola mahambo yeli muna zisingo za ngamiya wawo.<verse eid="JDG 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 8:22" />Maabaho Waisilaili wamulongela Gideoni, “Uwe mtawala wetu, uhakomeleza weye wachitawale welesi wako, kwaviya weye kuchikombola kulawa kwa Wamidiani.” <verse eid="JDG 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 8:23" />Gideoni kedika, “Niye sizakuwa mtawala wenu hebu welesi wangu. Mndewa Mulungu kezakuwa mtawala wenu.” <verse eid="JDG 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 8:24" />Kagendelela kulonga, “Nolonda nimpuleni chinhu chimwe, nopula chila imwe wenu yaning'he vipuli viyatekile.” Waja Wamidiani kwaviya wakala Waishumaili, wavala vipuli va zahabu.<verse eid="JDG 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 8:25" />Wanhu wamwidika, “Chizakwing'ha kwa hiyali.” Watandaza chiwalo na chila imwe kasa umo vipuli viwakalile wateka nyala. <verse eid="JDG 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 8:26" />Nzamo ya vipuli vose viyawalondile wamwing'he vikala chilo malongo maidi. Iviya kahokela mahambo na viwalo va ulujuani vovivaligwe na wafalume wa Midiani na mikufu yoikalile muna zisingo za ngamiya wawo. <verse eid="JDG 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 8:27" />Gideoni kazisang'hanila kutendela chizibawo choyachikile muna dibululu jake da Afula. Waisilaili wose wahita uko kuchitambikila. Chizibawo icho chiwakong'hela Gideoni na ndugu zake kumuleka Mulungu.<verse eid="JDG 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 8:28" />Basi, Wamidiani wapotigwa ng'hani sekewawe dumbizo kwa Isilaili, na isi ya Isilaili iwa na tindiwalo kwa lusita lwa miyaka malongo mane chipindi cha ugima wa Gideoni.<verse eid="JDG 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ifa ya Gideoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 8:29" />Yelubaali, niiyo Gideoni mwana wa Yoashi kabwela ukaye yake na kakala uko. <verse eid="JDG 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 8:30" />Kakala na wana wa chilume malongo saba, kwaviya kakala na wake wengi. <verse eid="JDG 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 8:31" />Iviya kakala na suliya uko Shekemu, kamwelekela mwana wa chilume, na kamtanga Abimeleki. <verse eid="JDG 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 8:32" />Gideoni mwana wa Yoashi kadanganika yahawa na miyaka mingi na kawandigwa muna dileme da tati yake Yoashi, uko Afula, bululu da lukolo lwa Abiezeli.<verse eid="JDG 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 8:33" />Viifosile ifa ya Gideoni Waisilaili kaidi wahinduka na wawatambikila Mabaali. Wamtenda Baali Belisi kuwa Mulungu wawo, <verse eid="JDG 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 8:34" />na wamzimiza Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wawo, yoyawakombole kulawa kwa wehi wawo wose wowawazunguluke. <verse eid="JDG 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 8:35" />Hawawatendele vinogile ndugu wa Yelubaali niiyo Gideoni kwa yanogile yose yoyatendile muna iisi ya Isilaili.<verse eid="JDG 8:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JDG 9" />
  <para style="s">Abimeleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 9:1" />Abimeleki mwana wa Yelubaali kahita kuna dibululu da Shekemu, kuwakalile ndugu wose wa mami yake, kawalongela, <verse eid="JDG 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 9:2" />“Wauzeni walangulizi wose wa Shekemu, ‘Dilihi dinogile kumwenu, mwizatawaligwa na wana wose malongo saba wa chilume wa Yelubaali hebu mwana imwe?’ Kumbukeni kuwa niye ndugu yenu.” <verse eid="JDG 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 9:3" />Ndugu wa mami yake walonga mbuli zino muna iisi yose ya Shekemu kwa ichimu chake na wanhu wose wa Shekemu wamsondelela kwaviya kakala ndugu yawo. <verse eid="JDG 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 9:4" />Wamwing'ha vihande malongo saba va hela vovikalile muna ikaye ya Baali Belisi. Kazisang'hanila kuwagoneka wanhu hawadumba chochose na wanhu chakachaka muladi wamsondelele. <verse eid="JDG 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 9:5" />Kaisondelela nawo kuhita Afula kwa tati yake, uko kawakoma ndugu zake wose malongo saba uchanyha ya dibwe dimwe. Mbali Yosamu mwana imdodo wa Gideoni kahonyoka, kwaviya kaifisa. <verse eid="JDG 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 9:6" />Maabaho walangulizi wose wa Shekemu na Besi Milo waiting'hana kuna dibiki dikulu dikalile habehi na uko Shekemu, wamtenda Abimeleki kuwa mfalume wawo.<verse eid="JDG 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 9:7" />Yosamu viyahulike ivo, kahita na kema kuna umulima wa Gelizimu na kalandula idizi, “Nitegelezeni, mweye wanhu wa Shekemu na Mulungu kezamtegelezani! <verse eid="JDG 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 9:8" />Siku dimwe mibiki ihita kusagula mfalume wawo, iulongela mzaituni, ‘Uwe mfalume wetu.’ <verse eid="JDG 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 9:9" />Mzaituni widika, ‘Vino mogesa nodaha kuleka kusang'hana sang'hano yangu ya kulava mavuta yohishimigwa na milungu na wanhu nimulangulizeni mweye?’ <verse eid="JDG 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 9:10" />Maabaho mibiki iulongela mtini, ‘Izo uwe mfalume wetu.’ <verse eid="JDG 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 9:11" />Mbali mtini widika, ‘Vino nodaha kuleka sang'hano yangu ya kulava matunda yanogile na yeli mulile muladi nikatawale mibiki?’ <verse eid="JDG 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 9:12" />Mibiki iulongela mzabibu, ‘Izo uwe mfalume wetu.’ <verse eid="JDG 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 9:13" />Mbali mzabibu widika, ‘Vino mogesa nodaha kuleka sang'hano yangu ya kulava divai yoiideng'heleza milungu na wanhu, nihite kuilanguliza mibiki?’ <verse eid="JDG 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 9:14" />Maabaho mibiki yose iulongela mbiki wa miwa, ‘Izo uwe mfalume wetu.’ <verse eid="JDG 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 9:15" />Mbiki wa miwa widika, ‘One kweli molonda kunitenda niye niwe mfalume wenu, izoni mukale muna imbeho yangu. One muhalema, moto wizalawa muna imibiki ya miwa na kuitimbula mielezi ya Lebanoni.’ ”<verse eid="JDG 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 9:16" />Yosamu kagendelela kulonga, “Vino mogesa momtenda Abimeleki kuwa mfalume kwa lungilo dinogile na kwa kumuhishimu Yelubaali na wanhu wa muna ikaye yake fana viyalondeke kwa sang'hano zake? <verse eid="JDG 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 9:17" />Kumbukeni tati yangu kaitowa kwa ichimu chenu. Katogola kuulava ugima wake muladi yamkomboleni kulawa muna yamakono ya Wamidiani. <verse eid="JDG 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 9:18" />Mbali diyelo muitowa kaye ya tati yangu na kuwakoma wana malongo saba uchanyha ya dibwe dimwe, maabaho mumtenda Abimeleki mwana wa msang'hani wake yawe mfalume wa wanhu wa Shekemu kwaviya ni munhu wa lukolo lwenu. <verse eid="JDG 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 9:19" />Lelo one mutenda yayo kwa lungilo dinogile na kwa kumuhishimu Yelubaali na wanhu wa muna ikaye yake, deng'heleleni hamwe na Abimeleki, nayo yadeng'helele hamwe na mweye. <verse eid="JDG 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 9:20" />Mbali one siyo ivo, moto ulawe kwa Abimeleki uwalunguze wanhu wa Shekemu na Besi Milo, maabaho moto ulawe kwa wanhu wa Shekemu na Besi Milo umtimbule Abimeleki.” <verse eid="JDG 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 9:21" />Maabaho Yosamu kaibanga na kakimbilila Beeli. Kakala uko kwaviya kamdumba Abimeleki ndugu yake.<verse eid="JDG 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 9:22" />Abimeleki katawala Isilaili kwa miyaka mitatu. <verse eid="JDG 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 9:23" />Maabaho Mulungu kawatenda Abimeleki na wanhu wa Shekemu waihile, nawo wamuleka Abimeleki. <verse eid="JDG 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 9:24" />Dino dilawilila muladi uja usede wowatendile wawo wana malongo saba wa Yelubaali ulihizigwe na zifa zawo ziwe mmwake Abimeleki ndugu yawo, yawakomile. Na zifa zawo ziwe mmwawo wanhu wa Shekemu waja wamtazile kuwakoma ndugu zake. <verse eid="JDG 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 9:25" />Wanhu wa Shekemu weka wanhu wamgaze Abimeleki kulawa kuna inhembeti ya mulima, wowahokile vinhu wanhu wafosile nzila iyo habehi nawo. Abimeleki kalongeligwa mbuli izo.<verse eid="JDG 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 9:26" />Maabaho Gaali mwana wa Ebedi kahita Shekemu na ndugu zake, wanhu wa Shekemu wamuhuwila. <verse eid="JDG 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 9:27" />Maabaho wose wahita kuna imigunda yawo ya mizabibu na kwaha zabibu na kuzisindika, watenda dugila. Wengila muna ikaye ya milungu yawo, waja na kung'wa, maabaho wamuliga Abimeleki. <verse eid="JDG 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 9:28" />Gaali kalonga, “Abimeleki iyo yelihi, na cheye hano Shekemu cha wanhu walingile vilihi mbaka chimsang'hanile Abimeleki? Vino, yeye siyo mwana Yelubaali? Vino Zebuli siyo mtazi wake? Lelo wasang'hanileni wanhu wa Hamoli, tata wa Shekemu. Habali chimsang'hanile Abimeleki? <verse eid="JDG 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 9:29" />Wanhu wano one wawile wangu, nihamsegezile Abimeleki. Nihamulongele Abimeleki, ‘Yongeza watowang'hondo wako, maabaho izo chiitowe!’ ”<verse eid="JDG 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 9:30" />Zebuli yeli mtawala wa bululu viyahulike mbuli izo ziyalongile Gaali mwana wa Ebedi kawona ludoko. <verse eid="JDG 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 9:31" />Kamtuma msenga yahite chinyele kwa Abimeleki, kalonga, “Gaali mwana wa Ebedi, hamwe na ndugu zake wengila muna dibululu da Shekemu na kukong'hela wihi kusonhela weye. <verse eid="JDG 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 9:32" />Lelo ubwele, weye na wanhu wako molondeka musegele ichilo na mumsepe muna imigunda habehi na bululu. <verse eid="JDG 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 9:33" />Imitondo zuwa vondadisomoze lamka uwatowe wanhu wa bululu. Maabaho Gaali na wanhu wake wahalawa kumgwilani, watende viudaha weye!”<verse eid="JDG 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 9:34" />Ivo Abimeleki na wanhu wake wasegela ichilo na kwiza Shekemu, kawagola wanhu wake vibumbila vine. <verse eid="JDG 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 9:35" />Abimeleki na wanhu wake viwamuwonile Gaali kolawa kunze na kwima muna ulwivi lwa dibululu, wenuka kulawa hanhu howaifisile. <verse eid="JDG 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 9:36" />Gaali kawawona na kamulongela Zebuli, “Lola! Kuna wanhu wohulumuka kulawa kuna inhembeti ya mulima!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 9:36">Zebuli kedika, “Waja siyo wanhu, yaja ni masisila ya milima.”<verse eid="JDG 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 9:37" />Gaali kalonga kaidi, “Lola! Kuna wanhu wohulumuka muna isi na chibumbila cholawa ubanzi wa Mwaloni wa Walaguzi.”<verse eid="JDG 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 9:38" />Maabaho Zebuli kamulongela, “Lelo magoda yako yakulihi? Nenza weye iyo ulongile, ‘Abimeleki iyo yelihi? Habali chimsang'hanile?’ Lelo wanhu wouwehule niiyo wawo. Lelo lawa kunze uitowe nawo.” <verse eid="JDG 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 9:39" />Gaali kawalongoza wanhu wa Shekemu na kuitowa na Abimeleki. <verse eid="JDG 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 9:40" />Abimeleki kamuwinga Gaali, nayo kamkimbila. Wanhu wengi walumila na wadanganika mzila mbaka kuna ulwivi lwa bululu. <verse eid="JDG 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JDG 9:41" />Abimeleki kakala Aluma, na Zebuli kamuwinga Gaali na ndugu zake kunze ya Shekemu, muladi sekewagendelele kukala umo.<verse eid="JDG 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JDG 9:42" />Igolo yake wanhu walawa wahita kuna imigunda na Abimeleki kalongeligwa. <verse eid="JDG 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JDG 9:43" />Ivo kawasola wanhu wake na kawagola muna ivibumbila vitatu. Waifisa muna imigunda kuwasepa. Kalola na kawawona wanhu wolawa kunze ya bululu, kalawa kunze, kawatowa na kuwakoma. <verse eid="JDG 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JDG 9:44" />Abimeleki na wanhu wake wakimbila kulukaliza ulwivi lwa bululu. Mabumbila yake yamwenga maidi wawatowa waja wakalile muna imigunda na wawakoma. <verse eid="JDG 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JDG 9:45" />Abimeleki kaitowa na wanhu wa bululu ijo siku ngima. Kadisola dibululu na kawakoma wanhu wose wakalile umo. Kadinanga dibululu kwa na keka munyu.<verse eid="JDG 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JDG 9:46" />Wanhu wose wakalile kuna dilingo da Shekemu viwahulike mbuli iyo, wakimbilila kuna ingome ya kaye ya imwe wa milungu yatangigwe Eli Belisi. <verse eid="JDG 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JDG 9:47" />Abimeleki kalongeligwa kuwa wanhu wose wakalile kuna dilingo da Shekemu waiting'hana hamwe. <verse eid="JDG 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JDG 9:48" />Abimeleki na wanhu wake wakwela kuna umulima Salimoni. Abimeleki kasola nhemo kakanha tambi da mbiki na kadigeleka muna diyega jake. Maabaho kawalongela wanhu waja woyakalile nawo, “Hima! Tendeni fana vinitendile niye.” <verse eid="JDG 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JDG 9:49" />Chila munhu kakanha tambi fana da Abimeleki. Wasola matambi yawo na wayasigamiza muna ing'huta ya mhongono. Wabwinha moto na kulunguza imhongono. Wanhu wose walume na wanaake, wopata alufu imwe wakalile kuna dilingo da Shekemu wadanganike.<verse eid="JDG 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JDG 9:50" />Maabaho Abimeleki kahita Sebesi, kadizingila dibululu na kaditeka. <verse eid="JDG 9:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JDG 9:51" />Uko kukala na lingo digangamale, chila mulume na chila muke na walangulizi wose, wakimbilila umo. Waihindila mgati na wakwela kuna dilingo ijo. <verse eid="JDG 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JDG 9:52" />Abimeleki kafika hana dilingo na kuwatowa, maabaho kaukwenhukila ulwivi wa dilingo muladi yaulunguze. <verse eid="JDG 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JDG 9:53" />Mbali mwanamke imwe kapigisa dibwe da kudundila, najo dimuhonda iditwi Abimeleki. <verse eid="JDG 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JDG 9:54" />Maabaho Abimeleki kamtanga mbwanga ija yeli mpagazi wa via vake va ng'hondo, kamulongela, “Lava panga jako, wanhu sekewalonge kuwa nikomigwa na mwanamke.” Mbwanga kasola panga jake, kamuhoma na kamkoma. <verse eid="JDG 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JDG 9:55" />Waisilaili viwawonile kuwa Abimeleki kadanganika, wasegela na chila munhu kabwela ukaye yake. <verse eid="JDG 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JDG 9:56" />Ivo niivo Mulungu viyamtaguse Abimeleki kwa ubananzi uyatendile tati yake wa kuwakoma ndugu zake malongo saba. <verse eid="JDG 9:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JDG 9:57" />Iviya Mulungu kawatenda wanhu wa Shekemu watagusigwe kwa wihi wawo uwatendile. Ivo duwilo da Yosamu mwana wa Gideoni diwapata.<verse eid="JDG 9:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JDG 10" />
  <para style="s">Tola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 10:1" />Viifosile ifa ya Abimeleki, Tola mwana wa Pua, mwana wa Dodo wa kabila da Isakali keza kuwakombola Waisilaili. Tola kakala uko Shamili muna iisi ya vilima va Efulaimu. <verse eid="JDG 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 10:2" />Kakala msemi wa Isilaili kwa miyaka malongo maidi na mitatu. Maabaho kadanganika na kawandigwa uko Shamili.<verse eid="JDG 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yaili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 10:3" />Viyafosile Tola keza Yaili kulawa Gileadi. Kawalanguliza Waisilaili kwa miyaka malongo maidi na midi. <verse eid="JDG 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 10:4" />Kakala na wana wa chilume malongo matatu wowakwelile vihongwe malongo matatu na wakala na mabululu malongo matatu muna iisi ya Gileadi, mbaka sambi yotangigwa Hawosi Yaili. <verse eid="JDG 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 10:5" />Yaili kadanganika na kawandigwa uko Kamoni.<verse eid="JDG 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 10:6" />Kaidi Waisilaili wamuhasanya Mndewa Mulungu kwa kuwatambikila Mabaali na Maashitalosi na milungu ya Shamu na ya Sidoni na ya Moabu na ya Amoni na ya Filisiti. Wamuleka Mndewa Mulungu na waleka kumtambikila. <verse eid="JDG 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 10:7" />Ivo Mndewa Mulungu kawehila Waisilaili, kawaguma muna yamakono ya Wafilisiti na Waamoni. <verse eid="JDG 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 10:8" />Kwa miyaka longo na minane wawagaza na wawananga Waisilaili wowokala uko Gileadi muna iisi ya Waamoli ubanzi wa ulawilo wa zuwa wa lwanda lwa Yoludani. <verse eid="JDG 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 10:9" />Waamoni waloka ulwanda lwa Yoludani muladi kuitowa na makabila ya Yuda na Benyamini na Efulaimu. Waisilaili wagaya ng'hani. <verse eid="JDG 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 10:10" />Maabaho Waisilaili wamulilila Mndewa Mulungu, walonga, “Chikuhasanya, kwaviya chikuleka weye Mulungu wetu na kuwatambikila Mabaali.”<verse eid="JDG 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 10:11" />Mndewa Mulungu kawedika, “Vino niye simkomboleni kulawa kwa Wamisili na Waamoli na Waamoni na Wafilisiti? <verse eid="JDG 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 10:12" />Iviya Wasidoni na Waamaleki na Wamaoni umwaka wamgezani na mweye munililila muladi nimtazeni, nimkombolani kulawa muna yamakono yawo. <verse eid="JDG 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 10:13" />Mbali munileka na motambikila milungu imwenga, ivo sizamkombolani kaidi. <verse eid="JDG 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 10:14" />Hiteni mukaililile milungu yomuisagule. Ilekeni imkomboleni vomukuwa muna yamagayo.”<verse eid="JDG 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 10:15" />Mbali Waisilaili wamulongela Mndewa Mulungu, “Chihasanya. Tenda vovose viulonda, mbali chokulamba diyelo uchikombole.” <verse eid="JDG 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 10:16" />Ivo waisegeza milungu ya isi zimwenga na wamtambikila Mndewa Mulungu. Nayo Mndewa Mulungu hagendelele kufunyila umoyo magayo ya Waisilaili.<verse eid="JDG 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 10:17" />Maabaho watowang'hondo da Waamoni waisasala kwa ng'hondo na weka lago uko Gileadi. Waisilaili waiting'hana na weka lago uko Misipa. <verse eid="JDG 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 10:18" />Uko walangulizi wa wanhu wa Gileadi wailongela, “Vino yelihi yondayanduse kuitowa na Waamoni? Yondayatende ivo niiyo yondayawe mulangulizi wa wanhu wose wokala Gileadi.”<verse eid="JDG 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JDG 11" />
  <para style="s">Yefita kowakombola Waisilaili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 11:1" />Yefita Mgileadi kakala galu, nayo kelekigwa na mwanamke malaya. Gileadi kamweleka Yefita. <verse eid="JDG 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 11:2" />Muke wa Gileadi keleka wana wa chilume, wana wawo viwakulile wamsegeza Yefita. Wamulongela, “Hwizahazi chinhu chochose kulawa kwa tati yetu, kwaviya weye ni mwana wa muke imwenga.” <verse eid="JDG 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 11:3" />Yefita kawakimbila ndugu zake na kahita kukala kuna iisi ya Tobu. Uko wanhu chaka waiduganya kuilumba nayo, wamsondelela muna imiyanza yake ya kuhoka vinhu. <verse eid="JDG 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 11:4" />Hamwande Waamoni waitowa na Isilaili, <verse eid="JDG 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 11:5" />walala wa Gileadi wahita kumsola Yefita kulawa muna iisi ya Tobu. <verse eid="JDG 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 11:6" />Walonga, “Izo uwe mkulu wetu wa watowang'hondo, muladi chidahe kuwatowa Waamoni.” <verse eid="JDG 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 11:7" />Yefita kawalongela walala wa Gileadi, “Vino siyo mweye munilemile na kuniwinga muna ikaye ya tati yangu? Lelo habali muhagaya mokwiza kumwangu?”<verse eid="JDG 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 11:8" />Walala wa Gileadi wamulongela Yefita, “Sambi chikubwelela muladi uhite hamwe na cheye chikaitowe na Waamoni, weye kwizakuwa mulangulizi wa wanhu wose wa Gileadi.”<verse eid="JDG 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 11:9" />Yefita kawalongela walala wa Gileadi, “One muhanibweleza ukaye kuitowa na Waamoli na Mndewa Mulungu yahanitenda nihume, nizakuwa mulangulizi wenu.”<verse eid="JDG 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 11:10" />Walala wa Gileadi wamulongela Yefita, “Mndewa Mulungu kezakuwa mkalangama hagati yetu, chizatenda fana viulongile.” <verse eid="JDG 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 11:11" />Ivo Yefita kahita na walala wa Gileadi na wanhu wamtenda kuwa mkulu wa watowang'hondo na mulangulizi wawo. Yefita kalonga mbuli zake uko Misipa haulongozi ha Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="JDG 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 11:12" />Maabaho Yefita kawatuma wasenga kwa mfalume wa Waamoni, wamulongele, “Weye kuna choni na cheye? Habali mwiza kuitowa isi yetu?”<verse eid="JDG 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 11:13" />Mfalume wa Waamoni kawedika wasenga wa Yefita, “Waisilaili viwalawile Misili, wasola isi yangu kulawa lwanda lwa Alinoni kuhita lwanda lwa Yaboki na lwanda lwa Yoludani. Lelo zisi izo zibwelezeni kwa tindiwalo.”<verse eid="JDG 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 11:14" />Yefita kawatuma kaidi wasenga wahite kwa mfalume wa Waamoni, <verse eid="JDG 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 11:15" />wamulongele, “Yefita kolonga, ‘Isilaili hasolile isi ya Moabu hebu isi ya Waamoni. <verse eid="JDG 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 11:16" />Mbali Waisilaili viwasegele Misili, wahita bahali ya Shamu mbaka Kadeshi kufosela muna dibwilingu. <verse eid="JDG 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 11:17" />Maabaho Waisilaili wawatuma wasenga kwa mfalume wa Edomu kumulamba yawatogolele wafosele muna iisi yake. Mbali mfalume wa Edomu hawatogolele bule. Iviya wampula mfalume wa Moabu, mbali nayo iviya hawatogolele bule. Ivo Waisilaili wasigala Kadeshi. <verse eid="JDG 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 11:18" />Maabaho wasegela kwa kufosela kuna dibwilingu kuzunguluka isi ya Edomu na Moabu mbaka viwafikile ubanzi wa ulawilo wa zuwa wa Moabu, weka lago kuumwambu wa lwanda lwa Alinoni, mbali hawengile Moabu. Lwanda lwa Alinoni niiyo mhaka ya Moabu. <verse eid="JDG 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 11:19" />Baho Waisilaili watuma wasenga kwa mfalume Sihoni wa Waamoli uko Heshiboni wakampule yawatogolele kufosa muna iisi yake wahite kuna isi yawo. <verse eid="JDG 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 11:20" />Mbali mfalume Sihoni hawatogolele bule. Kawaduganya watowang'hondo wake wose, weka lago uko Yahazi, kawatowa Waisilaili. <verse eid="JDG 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 11:21" />Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wa Isilaili, kawatenda Waisilaili wamuhume Sihoni na wanhu wake. Ivo Waisilaili wasola isi yose ya Waamoli wowakalile muna iisi ija. <verse eid="JDG 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 11:22" />Wasola isi yose ya Waamoli kwandusila lwanda lwa Alinoni ubanzi wa ulawilo wa zuwa mbaka lwanda lwa Yaboki ubanzi wa kasikazi na kulawa kuna dibwilingu ubanzi wa ulawilo wa zuwa mbaka lwanda lwa Yoludani ubanzi wa uswelo wa zuwa. <verse eid="JDG 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 11:23" />Ivo Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wa Isilaili, kawawinga Waamoli haulongozi wa wanhu wake Waisilaili. Weye kodahaze kuchihoka isi yetu? <verse eid="JDG 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 11:24" />Vino hwizasola chiya chiyokwing'ha mulungu wako Kemoshi? Chinhu chochose chiyaching'hile Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wetu, chizachisola. <verse eid="JDG 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 11:25" />Kogesa kuwa weye kunoga kufosa Balaki mwana wa Sipoli, mfalume wa Moabu? Vino haihumile na Waisilaili hebu kuitowa nawo? <verse eid="JDG 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 11:26" />Lusita Waisilaili viwakalile Heshiboni na vibululu vake, na bululu da Aloeli na mabululu yose yeli mumgwazogwazo wa lwanda lwa Alinoni na vibululu vake vose kwa lusita lwa miyaka magana matatu, habali lusita ulo huhakombole hanhu baho? <verse eid="JDG 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 11:27" />Niye sikubanange, mbali weye konibananga viutenda ng'hondo na niye. Diyelo Mndewa Mulungu yeli msemi kezahumiza hagati ya Waisilaili na Waamoni.’ ” <verse eid="JDG 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 11:28" />Mbali mfalume wa Amoni hategeleze usenga uno kulawa kwa Yefita.<verse eid="JDG 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 11:29" />Maabaho Muhe wa Mndewa Mulungu umwizila Yefita, kasegela na kafosela Gileadi na Manase na kubwelela Misipa ili uko Gileadi na kahita mbaka Amoni. <verse eid="JDG 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 11:30" />Yefita kamulahila Mndewa Mulungu, kalonga, “One uhawaguma Waamoni muna yamakono yangu, <verse eid="JDG 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 11:31" />yoyose yondayalawe kunze kulawa muna ikaye yangu kunihokela vondanibwele nihakomeleza kuwahuma Waamoni, kezakuwa wako, weye Mndewa Mulungu. Munhu iyo nizakulavila nhambiko ya kutimbula.”<verse eid="JDG 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 11:32" />Yefita kaloka ulwanda, kaitowa na Waamoni, na Mndewa Mulungu kaweka Waamoli muna yamakono yake. <verse eid="JDG 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 11:33" />Kaipatila uhumi mkulu, kasola mabululu malongo maidi yakalile hagati ya Aloeli hanhu hazunguluke Minisi na Abeli Kelamimu. Ivo Waamoni wahumigwa na Waisilaili. <verse eid="JDG 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 11:34" />Yefita viyakalile kobwela ukaye yake uko Misipa, mndele wake kalawa kumuhokela, kavina na katowa mhalati. Mwanage Yefita kakala iyo muhala. Yefita hakalile na mwana wa chilume hebu wa chike ila yeye muhala. <verse eid="JDG 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 11:35" />Yefita viyamuwonile, kasaula viwalo vake kwa usungu na kalonga, “Mndele wangu! Kunibena umoyo. Weye kuwa chandusilo chikulu cha uzidilwa kumwangu. Nimulahila Mndewa Mulungu, ivo sidaha kubena chilaho changu.”<verse eid="JDG 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 11:36" />Mndele wake kamwidika, “Tata fana kumulahila chinhu Mndewa Mulungu, basi nitendele fana viwikile chilagano, kwaviya sambi kakudahiza kuwalihiliza wehi wako Waamoni.” <verse eid="JDG 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 11:37" />Maabaho kamulongela tati yake, “Nokupula mbuli ino imwe, ning'he miyezi midi, nihite na mambwiya zangu kuna imilima, nikaillilile ifa yangu ning'hali sinasoligwa.” <verse eid="JDG 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 11:38" />Tati yake kamtogolela yahite uko kwa miyezi midi. Nayo kahita hamwe na mambwiya zake, muladi yalilile ifa yake yang'hali hanasoligwa mulume. <verse eid="JDG 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 11:39" />Viifosile miyezi midi kabwela ukaye, maabaho tati yake kamtendela fana viyailajile. Mndele iyo kakala hanaibandama na mulume yoyose.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 11:39">Lekamana kulawa baho kukala na chihendo chino muna isi ya Isilaili. <verse eid="JDG 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 11:40" />Chila mwaka wanaake wa Isilaili wahita kumulila siku nne ifa ya mndele wa Yefita Mgileadi.<verse eid="JDG 11:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JDG 12" />
  <para style="s">Yefita na wanhu wa Efulaimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 12:1" />Walume wa kabila da Efulaimu waiting'hana, waloka lwanda lwa Yoludani wafika Zafoni. Maabaho wamulongela Yefita, “Habali huchitangile muladi chihite hamwe na weye kwiitowa na Waamoni? Lelo chizaisoma kaye yako na weye uhawa mgati yake.”<verse eid="JDG 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 12:2" />Mbali Yefita kawalongela, “Niye na wanhu wangu chikala choiswela na Waamoni, vinimulambileni munitaze hamwizile kunikombola. <verse eid="JDG 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 12:3" />Viniwonile kuwa hamwizile kunikombola, niloka nihita moyo mumkono kuitowa na Waamoni, Mndewa Mulungu kanitendeza niwahume. Lelo habali mokwiza kuitowa na niye?”<verse eid="JDG 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 12:4" />Maabaho Yefita kawaduganya wanhu wose wa Gileadi, kaitowa na wanhu wa Efulaimu. Wanhu wa Gileadi wawahuma wanhu wa Efulaimu. Wanhu wano wa Efulaimu wawo walongile, “Mweye wanhu wa Gileadi ni wagendanzila kulawa kabila da Efulaimu, mokala hagati ya dikabila da Efulaimu na Manase.” <verse eid="JDG 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 12:5" />Maabaho wanhu wavamha viloko va lwanda lwa Yoludani muladi kuziba nzila ya wanhu wa Efulaimu. Chila siku kuyalawile mgendaji kalamba kufosa uko, wanhu wa Gileadi wamuuza, “Vino weye Muefulaimu?” Viyedike, “Bule,” <verse eid="JDG 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 12:6" />wamulongela, “Haya lelo longa mbuli, ‘Shibolesi.’ ” Mbali yeye kalonga, “Sibolesi,” kwaviya hadahile kutambula voilondeka, ivo wamgwila na wamkoma uko kuna iviloko va lwanda lwa Yoludani. Wanhu wa Efulaimu wopata 42,000 wakomigwa chipindi icho.<verse eid="JDG 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 12:7" />Yefita kawalanguliza Waisilaili kwa miyaka sita. Maabaho Yefita yeli Mgileadi kadanganika na kawandigwa kuna dibululu jake uko Gileadi. <verse eid="JDG 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 12:8" />Viyafosile Yefita, Ibizani kulawa Beselehemu kawalanguliza Waisilaili. <verse eid="JDG 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 12:9" />Kakala na wana malongo matatu wa chilume na malongo matatu wa chike. Kawafungiza zengele wanage wa chike kuna ulukolo lumwenga, iviya kapata wanaake malongo matatu kulawa kuna ulukolo lumwenga. Ibizani kawalanguliza Waisilaili kwa miyaka saba. <verse eid="JDG 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 12:10" />Maabaho Ibizani kadanganika na kawandigwa uko Beselehemu.<verse eid="JDG 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 12:11" />Viyafosile Ibizani, Eloni wa kabila da Zabuloni kawalanguliza Waisilaili kwa miyaka longo. <verse eid="JDG 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 12:12" />Maabaho Eloni kadanganika na kawandigwa uko Aiyaloni kuna iisi ya Zabuloni. <verse eid="JDG 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 12:13" />Viyafosile Eloni, Abidoni mwana wa Hileli kulawa Pilasoni kawalanguliza Waisilaili. <verse eid="JDG 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 12:14" />Kapata wana wa chilume malongo mane wa wazukulu wa chilume malongo matatu, wakwelile vihongwe malongo saba. Abidoni kawalanguliza Waisilaili kwa miyaka minane. <verse eid="JDG 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 12:15" />Maabaho Abidoni mwana wa Hileli kadanganika na kawandigwa kuna dibululu da Pilasoni dili kuna iisi ya mulima wa Efulaimu kowakalile Waamaleki.<verse eid="JDG 12:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JDG 13" />
  <para style="s">Kwelekwa kwa Samsoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 13:1" />Waisilaili wamuhasanya kaidi Mndewa Mulungu, nayo kawaleka watawaligwe na Wafilisiti kwa miyaka malongo mane.<verse eid="JDG 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 13:2" />Siku izo kukala na munhu imwe wa bululu da Zola wa kabila da Dani, zina jake Manoa. Muke wake kakala mgumba. <verse eid="JDG 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 13:3" />Msenga wa kuulanga wa Mndewa Mulungu kamulawilila muke iyo na kamulongela, “Weye kwamgumba na kwabule mwana, mbali kwizapata wimo na kwizakweleka mwana wa chilume. <verse eid="JDG 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 13:4" />Ivo wiiteganye, sekeung'we divai hebu chinhu chochose chikola, hebu sekeuje chinhu chochose chambule mwiko, <verse eid="JDG 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 13:5" />kwaviya kwizapata wimo na kwizakweleka mwana wa chilume. Nyele za mwana iyo siku zose sekeziweguligwe, kwaviya kwandusila kwelekigwa kwake kezakuwa Mnazili yotuligwa kwa Mulungu kwa sang'hano yelile. Nayo kezakwandusa kuwakombola Waisilaili muna yamakono ya Wafilisiti.”<verse eid="JDG 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 13:6" />Maabaho mwanamke ija kahita kwa mulumake na kamulongela, “Munhu wa Mulungu kanizila, chihanga chake kalinga fana msenga wa Mulungu wa kudumbiza ng'hani. Simuuzile kalawahi, nayo hanilongele zina jake. <verse eid="JDG 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 13:7" />Mbali kanilongela, ‘Kwizapata wimo na kwizakweleka mwana wa chilume. Kanilongela sekening'we divai hebu chinhu chikola hebu sekenije chinhu chochose chambule mwiko, kwaviya mwana kezakuwa katuligwa kwa Mulungu siku zose za ugima wake.’ ”<verse eid="JDG 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 13:8" />Maabaho Manoa kampula Mndewa Mulungu, kalonga, “Weye Mndewa Mulungu, nokulamba umtume kaidi munhu ija iumtumile, muladi yachifunze mbuli zochilondeka kumtendela imwana yondayelekigwe.”<verse eid="JDG 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 13:9" />Mulungu kahulika pulo da Manoa na msenga wa Mulungu kamuhitila kaidi ija mwanamke viyakalile kumgunda, mbali Manoa mulumake hakalile hamwe nayo bule. <verse eid="JDG 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 13:10" />Mwanamke kakimbila himahima kamulongela mulumake, “Lola, munhu yoyanilawilile siku ija kanilawilila kaidi.”<verse eid="JDG 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 13:11" />Manoa kenuka na kamsondelela muke wake. Viyamfikile munhu iyo kamuuza, “Vino weye iyo munhu ija yalongile na muke ino?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 13:11">Nayo kamwidika, “Ena.”<verse eid="JDG 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 13:12" />Maabaho Manoa kalonga, “Mbuli zako vondazifike, mwana iyo kezakuwaze na kezatenda sang'hano yaki?”<verse eid="JDG 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 13:13" />Msenga wa Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Manoa, “Muke wako kolondeka yatende chila chinhu chonimulongele. <verse eid="JDG 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 13:14" />Kolondeka sekeyaje chinhu chochose chochilawile muna umzabibu hebu sekeyang'we divai hebu chinhu chikola hebu sekeyaje chinhu chochose chambule mwiko. Yatende chila chinhu chonimulagilize.”<verse eid="JDG 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 13:15" />Manoa kamulongela msenga wa Mndewa Mulungu, “Chokulamba ukale chidogo chikusasalile mwanaluti uje.”<verse eid="JDG 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 13:16" />Mbali msenga wa Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Manoa, “Hata fana koniwangiliza nikale, sizakuja ndiya yenu. Mbali one uhalonda sasala nhambiko ya kutimbula, kolondeka umulavile Mndewa Mulungu.” Kwaviya Manoa havimanyile bule kuwa iyo kakala msenga wa Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="JDG 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 13:17" />Manoa kamulongela msenga wa Mndewa Mulungu, “Weye yelihi, muladi mbuli zako vondaziwe kweli chikuhishimu?”<verse eid="JDG 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 13:18" />Msenga wa Mndewa Mulungu kalonga, “Hulondeka kudimanya zina jangu. Na one uhadimanya, dizakwazanya.”<verse eid="JDG 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 13:19" />Ivo Manoa kasola mwanaluti na nhosa ya usage, kavitimbula hana uluwe lwa Mndewa Mulungu. Msenga iyo katenda mbuli za mauzauza, Manoa na muke wake wakala walola. <verse eid="JDG 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 13:20" />Lambi da moto vidihitile kuulanga kulawa hana ulupango, msenga iyo wa Mndewa Mulungu kahita kuulanga muna dilambi da moto wa hana ulupango. Manoa na muke wake walola na waidulika mbaka vihanga vidalisa hasi.<verse eid="JDG 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 13:21" />Msenga wa Mulungu hawalawilile kaidi Manoa na muke wake, ivo Manoa kavimanya kuwa iyo kakala msenga wa Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="JDG 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 13:22" />Manoa kamulongela muke wake, “Kweli cheye chizadanganika, kwaviya chimuwona Mulungu!”<verse eid="JDG 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 13:23" />Mbali muke wake kamwidika, “Mndewa Mulungu one yalondile kuchikoma, sigambeyatogole nhambiko yetu ya kutimbula na nhosa yetu ya usage. Wala sigambeyachilagusile hebu kuchilongela mbuli zino.”<verse eid="JDG 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 13:24" />Maabaho muke keleka mwana wa chilume na kamwing'ha zina jake Samsoni. Mwana iyo kakula na Mndewa Mulungu kamtemela mate. <verse eid="JDG 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 13:25" />Muhe wa Mndewa Mulungu wandusa kumgangamiza viyakalile Mahane Dani hagati ya bululu da Zola na Eshitaoli.<verse eid="JDG 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JDG 14" />
  <para style="s">Samsoni kosola muke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 14:1" />Samsoni kahita Timina, uko kamuwona mndele imwe Mfilisiti. <verse eid="JDG 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 14:2" />Viyabwelile, kawalongela tati yake na mami yake, “Uko Timina nimuwona muke imwe Mfilisiti munisolele muke iyo, nolonda yawe muke wangu.”<verse eid="JDG 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 14:3" />Tati yake na mami yake wamuuza, “Vino habule muke yoyose mwa ndugu zako hebu mwa Waisilaili wamwenga mbaka uhite kusola muke kwa Wafilisiti hawagumigwe ulungwana?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:3">Mbali Samsoni kamulongela tati yake, “Nisoleleni muke iyo, kwaviya kaninogela ng'hani.”<verse eid="JDG 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 14:4" />Tati yake na mami yake hawavimanyile kuwa Mndewa Mulungu komtendeza Samsoni yatende vino, kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kakala kozahila nzila ya kuwatowa Wafilisiti. Lusita ulo Wafilisiti wakala wotawala Isilaili.<verse eid="JDG 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 14:5" />Ivo Samsoni kahita Timina hamwe na tati yake na mami yake. Viwafikile kuna imigunda ya mizabibu ya Timina, mwanasimba kalawilila kuno kotongoloma. <verse eid="JDG 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 14:6" />Baho muhe wa Mndewa Mulungu umwingila Samsoni kwa nguvu na kamdega simba iyo fana munhu viyodega mwanaluti. Na Samsoni hawalongele bule tati yake na mami yake mbuli iyo.<verse eid="JDG 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 14:7" />Maabaho kasegela kahita kulonga na imwanamke iyo, muke iyo kanogelwa ng'hani na Samsoni. <verse eid="JDG 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 14:8" />Vizifosile siku siyo nyingi, kahita kumsola mwanamke ija. Viyafikile muna inzila kahinduka kumgwazo kuulola mtufi uja wa simba, humbe mgati ya mtufi kukala na nyuki ivugile. <verse eid="JDG 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 14:9" />Kapakula uki kwa makono yake kakala koja kuno kogendelela na mwanza wake. Viyawafikile tati yake na mami yake, kaweng'ha uki nawo waja. Mbali hawalongele kuwa uki uwo kaulava muna umtufi wa simba.<verse eid="JDG 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 14:10" />Tati yake kahita ukaye kwa imuke ija, uko Samsoni katenda dugila, fana viwatendile wabwanga siku izo. <verse eid="JDG 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 14:11" />Wafilisiti viwamuwone, wamwing'ha wabwanga wayage malongo matatu wakale nayo kwa dugila.<verse eid="JDG 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 14:12" />Samsoni kawalongela, “Lekeni nimuuzeni chitendawili. One muhadaha kufambula chitendawili icho kwa lusita lwa siku saba za dugila da sola, nizamwing'hani viwalo malongo matatu va chitani na viwalo malongo matatu va dugila. <verse eid="JDG 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 14:13" />Mbali one hamudahile kufambula, mwizaning'ha viwalo malongo matatu va chitani na malongo matatu va dugila.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:13">Nawo wamwidika, “Haya tega chihulike.”<verse eid="JDG 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 14:14" />Kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:14">“Kwa mjaji kulawa chinhu cha kuja,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:14">kwa mwene nguvu kulawa chinhu chili mulile.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:14">Vizifosile siku nhatu wakala wang'hali hawanategula ichitendawili.<verse eid="JDG 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 14:15" />Siku yesaba wamulongela muke wa Samsoni, “Muhembeleze mulumako yachilongele fambulo da chitendawili chino. One uhalema chizatuma moto kuna ikaye ya tati yako nawo wizakulunguza. Vino mweye muchigoneka hano muladi kuchihoka vinhu vetu?”<verse eid="JDG 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 14:16" />Ivo muke wa Samsoni kahita kwa Samsoni kuno masozi yolawa na kalonga, “Hunilonda bule! Konihila! Kuwauza mbwiya zangu chitendawili na niye hunilongele bule fambulo jake!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:16">Samsoni kalonga, “Lola, hata tati yangu na mami yangu siwalongele. Habali nikulongele weye?” <verse eid="JDG 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 14:17" />Kalila siku zose saba za dugila. Mbali siku yesaba kamulongela fambulo da chitendawili icho, kwaviya kamuwangiliza ng'hani. Maabaho imuke kawalongela wanhu wake.<verse eid="JDG 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 14:18" />Ivo siku yesaba ding'hali zuwa hadinakuswa, wanhu wa dibululu wamulongela fambulo da ichitendawili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:18">“Choni chili mulile kufosa uki?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:18">Choni chili na nguvu kufosa simba?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:18">Samsoni kedika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:18">“One hamulimile na ng'ombe wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:18">sigambemumanye voilondeka kunidika sambi.”<verse eid="JDG 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 14:19" />Baho muhe wa Mndewa Mulungu umwizila Samsoni kwa nguvu, nayo kahita kuna dibululu da Ashikeloni, kawakoma wanhu malongo matatu, maabaho kasola viwalo vawo va dugila, kaweng'ha waja wategule chitendawili chake. Maabaho kasegela, kahita kwa tati yake kuno kana ludoko. <verse eid="JDG 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 14:20" />Muke wa Samsoni keng'higwa mbwanga imwenga yakalile mbwiyake yowataze muna isiku ya dugila da sola.<verse eid="JDG 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JDG 15" />
  <para style="s">Samsoni kowahuma Wafilisiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 15:1" />Hamwande, lusita lwa kuhulula ngano, Samsoni kasola mwanaluti na kahita kumulaula muke wake. Kalonga, “Nohita kuna ichiheleto cha muke wangu.” Mbali tata wa muke wake kamulema sekeyengile.<verse eid="JDG 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 15:2" />Kamwidika Samsoni, “Nigesa kumwihila mwanangu, ivo nimwing'ha mbwiyako. Mbali mdodo wake kanoga kufosa yeye. Nokulamba umsole ino badala yake.” <verse eid="JDG 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 15:3" />Samsoni kalonga, “Mwanza uno sizalongigwa vihile kwa chiya chondaniwatendele Wafilisiti!” <verse eid="JDG 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 15:4" />Samsoni kahita na kagwila mbwizi magana matatu. Maabaho kasola miwenge ya moto na kawafunga iwambwizi mkila kwa mkila. Keka milenge hagati ya mikila midi. <verse eid="JDG 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 15:5" />Viyakomeleze kubwinha miwenge ija, kawalekela mbwizi hagati ya ngano ya Wafilisiti, katimbula makinza ya ngano na ngano ili ing'hali hainahunigwa, mbaka migunda ya mizabibu na mizaituni. <verse eid="JDG 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 15:6" />Wafilisiti viwauzile, “Yelihi yatendile vino?” Walonga, “Samsoni, mkoi wa ija Mtimina kwaviya kasola muke wake kamwing'ha miyage” Wafilisiti wahita kumtimbula muke iyo na tati yake kwa moto.<verse eid="JDG 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 15:7" />Samsoni kawalongela, “Vino ivo mutenda? Noilaha kuwa sizasegela mbaka vondanimulihilizeni!” <verse eid="JDG 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 15:8" />Ivo kawatowa ng'hani na kuwakoma wengi. Maabaho kahita kukala muna dituka da luwe lwa Etamu.<verse eid="JDG 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samsoni kowahuma Wafilisiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 15:9" />Wafilisiti weza, weka lago jawo muna iisi ya Yuda na waisasala kuditowa bululu da Lehi. <verse eid="JDG 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 15:10" />Wanhu wa Yuda wawauza, “Habali mwiza kuchitowa?” Nawo wawedika, “Chiza muladi chimfunge Samsoni na kumtendela fana viyachitendele.” <verse eid="JDG 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 15:11" />Wanhu 3,000 wa Yuda wamuhitila Samsoni kuna dituka da luwe lwa Etamu wamulongela, “Vino hamuvimanyile kuwa Wafilisiti wochitawala? Lola mwila wouchitendele!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:11">Samsoni kawedika, “Fana viwanitendele, niivo voniwatendele.” <verse eid="JDG 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 15:12" />Wamulongela, “Chiza kukufunga muladi chikugume muna yamakono yawo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:12">Samsoni kawalongela, “Nilahileni kuwa mweye wenyewo hamwizanikoma.”<verse eid="JDG 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 15:13" />Nawo wamulongela, “Hachizakukoma mbali chizakufunga na kukuguma muna yamakono yawo.” Ivo wamfunga mizabi midi ya sambi na kumulava kulawa muna uluwe. <verse eid="JDG 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 15:14" />Viyafikile Lehi, Wafilisiti wamkimbilila kuno woguta nyangi. Baho muhe wa Mndewa Mulungu umwizila Samsoni kwa nguvu na zinzabi ziya ziwamfungile muna yamakono yake zifunguka fana chitani chamhile moto, na vifungo vilagala hasi. <verse eid="JDG 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 15:15" />Samsoni kapata usaya wa mhunda, kausang'hanila kuwakomela wanhu 1,000. <verse eid="JDG 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 15:16" />Maabaho Samsoni kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 15:16">“Kwa usaya wa mhunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 15:16">niduganya mafungu ya mitufi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 15:16">Kwa usaya wa mhunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 15:16">niwakoma wanhu 1,000.”<verse eid="JDG 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 15:17" />Viyakomeleze kulonga kawasa usaya uwo. Hanhu baho hatangigwa Lamasi Lehi, fambulo jake mulima wa usaya.<verse eid="JDG 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 15:18" />Kwaviya Samsoni kakala na ng'hilu ng'hani, kampula Mndewa Mulungu, kalonga, “Kuning'ha niye, msang'hani wako uhumi mkulu. Lelo sambi kwizanileka nidanganike na ng'hilu na kugwa muna yamakono ya wanhu hawengile ulungwana?” <verse eid="JDG 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 15:19" />Mulungu kafungula hanhu hakalile na kombo uko Lehi, maabaho mazi yalawa. Samsoni kang'wa mazi yayo na nguvu zake zimbwelela. Nzasa iyo itangigwa Eni Hakole, iyo yauko Lehi mbaka diyelo. <verse eid="JDG 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 15:20" />Samsoni kakala msemi wa Waisilaili kwa miyaka malongo maidi muna zisiku za Wafilisiti.<verse eid="JDG 15:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JDG 16" />
  <para style="s">Samsoni na Delila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 16:1" />Siku dimwe Samsoni kahita bululu da Gaza, uko kaiting'hana na malaya imwe kambandama. <verse eid="JDG 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 16:2" />Wanhu wa Gaza viwalongeligwe, “Samsoni kauko!” Ivo wahazunguluka hanhu baho na kumsepa kuna ulwivi lwa bululu ichilo chose. Hana ulwivi wa dibululu wakala hupi chilo chose, walonga, “Chimgoze mbaka mhwaniyau baho chizamkoma.” <verse eid="JDG 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 16:3" />Basi Samsoni kagona mbaka chilo chikulu, kasegela hagati ichilo, kamha nyivi za hanhu ha kwingilila muna dibululu, na mhanda zake mbili, kang'ola hamwe na mhalalingo yake, kagelega muna diyega, kavipapa mbaka kuchany'ha kuna umulima uli habehi na Hebuloni.<verse eid="JDG 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 16:4" />Maabaho Samsoni kamnogela muke yatangigwe Delila, yakalile kuna dibawe da Soleki. <verse eid="JDG 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 16:5" />Wafalume wa Wafilisiti wamuhitila muke iyo na walonga, “Mgeze Samsoni kwa kumuuza chandusilo cha nguvu zake nyingi na chodahaze kumuhuma. Chidahe kumtataliza na kumgaza. Chila imwe wetu yondayadahe kutenda ivo kezakwing'ha hela elufu na magana dimwe.”<verse eid="JDG 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 16:6" />Ivo Delila kamulongela Samsoni, “Nilongele choni chandusilo cha nguvu zako nyingi na kwizatatalizigwa vilihi muladi uhumigwe.”<verse eid="JDG 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 16:7" />Samsoni kedika, “One wahanifunga na nzabi mbisi saba, nizakuwa nabule nguvu fana wanhu wamwenga.” <verse eid="JDG 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 16:8" />Ivo wafalume wa Wafilisiti wamgalila Delila nzabi saba mbisi, nayo kamtataliza Samsoni. <verse eid="JDG 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 16:9" />Kukala na wanhu wamwenga muna ichiheleto chimwenga, ivo kaguta nyangi, “Samsoni! Wafilisiti wokwiza!” Mbali kadumula zinzabi fana viya luzi lwa pamba volukanhigwe uhadalisigwa na moto. Ivo wagendelela kuwa hawachimanyile chandusilo cha nguvu zake.<verse eid="JDG 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 16:10" />Maabaho Delila kamulongela Samsoni, “Lola, kunizeha na kunivwizila. Nokulamba nilongele munhu kodahaze kukufunga.”<verse eid="JDG 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 16:11" />Kamwidika, “One wahanifunga kwa nzabi za sambi ziya hazinasang'haniligwa, nizakuwa nyondenyonde fana wanhu wamwenga.”<verse eid="JDG 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 16:12" />Ivo Delila kasola nzabi za sambi na kamfunga. Maabaho kalonga, “Samsoni! Wafilisiti wokwiza!” Wanhu wakala wogozela kuna ichiheleto chimwenga. Mbali yeye kadumula zinzabi muna yamakono yake fana luzi.<verse eid="JDG 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 16:13" />Delila kamulongela Samsoni, “Ung'hali konizeha na hunilongela ukweli bule. Nilongele munhu kodahaze kukufunga.” Samsoni kamwidika, “Uhaviluka makonga saba ya nyele zangu muna ivisingija va diwalo na kuviwambilila kwa vigingi, nizakuwa nyondenyonde fana munhu imwenga yoyose.” <verse eid="JDG 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 16:14" />Basi kazifunga kwa ichigingi na kamulongela, “Samsoni! Wafilisiti wokwiza.” Nayo kalamka muna zinhongo, kang'ola ichigingi na kadidega ija diwalo. <verse eid="JDG 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 16:15" />Ivo Delila kalonga, “Habali kolonga konilonda na humbe haili ivo bule? Kunizeha miyanza mitatu, na ung'hali hunanilongela choni chochikutenda uwe na nguvu.” <verse eid="JDG 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 16:16" />Delila kagendelela kamulamba Samsoni chila siku mbaka kalegela ng'hani. <verse eid="JDG 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 16:17" />Baho Samsoni kamulongela Delila ukweli wose, kalonga, “Nyele zangu hazilondeka kuweguligwa. Mulungu kanitula kuwa Mnazili wake kwandusila vinyelekigwe. Nyele zangu one ziweguligwe nihagize nguvu zangu na kuwa bila nguvu fana wanhu wamwenga.”<verse eid="JDG 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 16:18" />Delila viyavimanyile kuwa kamulongela ukweli, katuma msenga kwa wafalume wa Wafilisiti na kalonga, “Izoni mwanza uno muhala. Kanilongela ukweli.” Maabaho wahita na wamwing'ha zihela zowamulaganile. <verse eid="JDG 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 16:19" />Nayo Delila kamtenda Samsoni yagone nhongo muna yamavindi yake, kamtanga munhu yamuwegule viya ivifungu saba va nyele muna iditwi jake. Maabaho Delila kandusa kumgaza Samsoni kwaviya nguvu zake zikala zagile. <verse eid="JDG 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 16:20" />Delila kamulongela Samsoni, “Samsoni! Wafilisiti wokwiza kukutowa!” Samsoni kalamka muna zinhongo kuno kagesa kuwa kezalawa na kuigombela fana uchanduso. Humbe havimanyile kuwa Mndewa Mulungu kamuleka. <verse eid="JDG 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 16:21" />Wafilisiti wamgwila, wamng'ola meso yake, wamgala Gaza, wamfunga mhingu za shaba na wamuwangiliza yatende usang'hano wa kudunda usage uko kuna ichifungo. <verse eid="JDG 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 16:22" />Mbali nyele zake zandusa kota kaidi.<verse eid="JDG 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ifa ya Samsoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 16:23" />Wafalume wa Wafilisiti waiting'hana na kudeng'helela muladi wamulavile zabihu mulungu wawo yatangigwe Dagoni. Basi wakala wokwimba, “Mulungu wetu kamwika mwihi wetu Samsoni muna yamakono yetu.” <verse eid="JDG 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 16:24" />Wanhu viwamuwonile Samsoni wamwing'ha hewela mulungu wawo na kulonga, “Mulungu wetu kamwika mwihi wetu Samsoni muna yamakono yetu, ija yakalile kobananga isi yetu na kuwakoma wengi wetu.” <verse eid="JDG 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 16:25" />Viwamemigwe na deng'ho ng'hani muna imizoyo yawo, walonga, “Mgaleni Samsoni muladi chimzehe.” Basi wamulava Samsoni muna ichifungo, wamgala, nawo wamzeha. Viwamwikile hagati ya mhanda, <verse eid="JDG 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 16:26" />Samsoni kamulongela mbwanga yakalile komulongoza, “Nileke nibabase mhanda zozizengeligwe ikaye muladi nigimile.” <verse eid="JDG 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 16:27" />Kaye iyo ikala imemile wanhu, wafalume wose wa Wafilisiti wakala umo. Kuna digulu <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:27 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">digulu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa vihendo va Waisilaili wanhu wodaha kukala kudigulu kwa viya kaye zawo zikala zigoloka.</char></note>kukala na wanhu 3,000 walume na wanaake, kuno womzeha Samsoni.<verse eid="JDG 16:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 16:28" />Baho Samsoni kamtanga Mndewa Mulungu, “Mndewa Mulungu, nokulamba unikumbuke. Nigume nguvu mwanza uno umwe muhala, weye Mulungu, muladi niwalihilize Wafilisiti wano mwanza umwe muhala, wano wowang'olile meso yangu.” <verse eid="JDG 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 16:29" />Ivo Samsoni kamha mhanda mbili za hagati ya kaye ija, kazigimila, imwe mkono wake wa kumoso na imwenga mkono wake wa kulume. <verse eid="JDG 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 16:30" />Samsoni kalonga, “Leka nidanganike na Wafilisiti!” Kasung'ha kwa nguvu zake zose, na ikaye iwagwila wafalume na wamwenga wose. Samsoni kawakoma wanhu wengi muna iifa yake kufosa muna uugima wake.<verse eid="JDG 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 16:31" />Ndugu zake na wanhu wake weza kusola mtufi wake, wamuwanda hagati ya bululu da Zola na bululu da Eshitaoli hana dileme da Manoa, tati yake. Samsoni kakala msemi wa Isilaili kwa miyaka malongo maidi.<verse eid="JDG 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JDG 17" />
  <para style="s">Nyang'hiti za milungu za Mika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 17:1" />Kuna iisi ya vilima va Efulaimu kukala na munhu imwe, zina jake Mika. <verse eid="JDG 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 17:2" />Siku dimwe kamulongela mami yake, “Viya vihande va hela elufu imwe na gana dimwe voubawiligwe na weye kumduwila ija yakubawile. Niye nihulika, ninavo, nivisola niye.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 17:2">Mami yake kalonga, “Mwanangu, utemeligwe mate na Mndewa Mulungu.”<verse eid="JDG 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 17:3" />Mika kambwelezela mami yake viya vihande va hela elufu imwe na gana dimwe. Mami yake kalonga, “Muladi duwilo donilavile sekedikupate, hela ino noika kwa sang'hano ya Mndewa Mulungu muladi kutendela nyang'hiti ya mulungu wa kusongola na kunonela ihakigwe na hela. Lelo nokubwelezela vihande va hela.”<verse eid="JDG 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 17:4" />Mika viyambwelezele mami yake hela iyo, mami yake kasola vihande va hela magana maidi, kamwing'ha muhunzi wa hela ija yoyafuwile nyang'hiti ya kusongola na kunonela. Nyang'hiti iyo ikigwa muna ikaye ya Mika. <verse eid="JDG 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 17:5" />Munhu ino Mika kakala na hanhu hake ha kutambikila. Katenda chizibawo cha mkulu wa nhambiko na nyang'hiti, maabaho kamtenda imwe wa wanage kuwa mkulu wa nhambiko wake. <verse eid="JDG 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 17:6" />Siku izo Isilaili hakukalile na mfalume, chila munhu katenda viyalondile mwenyewo.<verse eid="JDG 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 17:7" />Iviya siku izo kukala na Mulawi mdodo yoyakalile fana nyambenyambe kuna dibululu da Beselehemu dili uko Yuda. <verse eid="JDG 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 17:8" />Munhu iyo kasegela muna dibululu da Beselehemu dili muna iisi ya Yuda, muladi yakazahile hanhu hamwenga ha kukala. Viyakalile yogenda, kafika kuna ikaye ya Mika kuna iisi ya vilima va Efulaimu. <verse eid="JDG 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 17:9" />Mika kamuuza, “Kulawa kulihi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 17:9">Nayo kamwidika, “Niye ni Mulawi kulawa Beselehemu muna iisi ya Yuda, nozahila hanhu ha kukala.”<verse eid="JDG 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 17:10" />Mika kalonga, “Kala hamwe na niye, uwe fana tata kumwangu na mkulu wa nhambiko wangu. Nizakuliha vihande longo va hela chila mwaka na viwalo hamwe na chila chinhu chiulonda.” <verse eid="JDG 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 17:11" />Ivo Mulawi katogola kukala nayo, mbwanga iyo yeli Mulawi kumwake kakala fana imwe wa wanage. <verse eid="JDG 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 17:12" />Mika kamsagula Mulawi iyo kuwa mkulu wa nhambiko wake, kakala muna ikaye ya Mika. <verse eid="JDG 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 17:13" />Maabaho Mika kalonga, “Sambi novimanya kuwa Mndewa Mulungu kezatenda vinhu vangu vihite goya, kwaviya Mulawi kawa mkulu wa nhambiko wangu.”<verse eid="JDG 17:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JDG 18" />
  <para style="s">Mika na kabila da Dani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 18:1" />Siku izo Isilaili kukala kwabule mfalume.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 18:1">Siku izo wanhu wa kabila da Dani waizahilila uhazi wapate hanhu ha kukala kwaviya hawapatile isi yawo muna yamakabila ya Isilaili. <verse eid="JDG 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 18:2" />Ivo wanhu wa kabila da Dani wasagula wanhu watano magalu viweli na wawatuma kulawa uko Eshitaoli na bululu da Zola wawalagiliza wahite kuipelemba isi. Ivo wanhu wawo wafika kuna iisi ya vilima va Efulaimu ukaye kwa Mika na wakala uko. <verse eid="JDG 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 18:3" />Viwafikile habehi na kaye ya Mika, viwamtegeleze Mulawi ija viyolonga wammanya kuwa siyo mkaya wa baho, ivo wamuhitila na wamuuza, “Yelihi yakugalile hano? Hano kotendaki? Weye kuna sang'hano yaki hano?”<verse eid="JDG 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 18:4" />Kawedika, “Mika kanitenda niwe msang'hani wake, niwa mkulu wa nhambiko wake.”<verse eid="JDG 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 18:5" />Maabaho wamulongela, “Chokulamba uchiuzile kwa Mulungu fana mwanza wetu wizanoga.”<verse eid="JDG 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 18:6" />Mkulu wa nhambiko kawedika, “Hiteni kwa tindiwalo. Mndewa Mulungu komkalizani muna umwanza wenu.”<verse eid="JDG 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 18:7" />Wanhu wawo watano wasegela na wahita Laishi. Wawawona wanhu wakalile uko, na viya viwakalile vinogile fana wanhu wa Sidoni. Wakala wanhu goya welibule ludumbo na hawahungukilwe na chinhu chochose muna iisi. Wakala kutali na wanhu wa Sidoni na wakala hawaitogolele na zisi zimwenga kuwataza.<verse eid="JDG 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 18:8" />Viwabwelile uko Zola na Eshitaoli, ndugu zawo wawauza, “Muchigalila mbuli zilingile vilihi?”<verse eid="JDG 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 18:9" />Wedika, “Inukeni chihite chikaitowe isi iyo. Chiiwona isi iyo, kweli inoga ng'hani. Sekemukale hano bila kutenda chinhu. Hima! Ingileni na muisole! <verse eid="JDG 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 18:10" />Vondamufike uko, mwizawafika wanhu welibule ludumbo. Isi iyo ni ng'hulu haihungukilwe na chinhu chochose na Mulungu kaika muna yamakono yetu.”<verse eid="JDG 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 18:11" />Ivo wanhu magana sita wa kabila da Dani wasegela bululu da Zola na Eshitaoli, waisasala kwa ng'hondo. <verse eid="JDG 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 18:12" />Wahita na weka lago jawo uko Kiliasi Yealimu muna iisi ya Yuda. Lekamana hanhu baho ubanzi wa uswelo wa zuwa wa Kiliasi Yealimu hotangigwa Mahane Dani mbaka diyelo. <verse eid="JDG 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 18:13" />Kulawa uko wahita kuna iisi ya vilima va Efulaimu na wafika kuna ikaye ya Mika.<verse eid="JDG 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 18:14" />Wanhu waja watano wahitile kuipelemba isi ya Laishi wawalongela ndugu zawo, “Vino movimanya kuwa kaye imwe muna zikaye zino ina chizibawo na nyang'hiti za milungu na nyang'hiti zihakigwe shaba? Lelo geseni va kutenda.” <verse eid="JDG 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 18:15" />Ivo wahita kuna ikaye ya Mika koyakalile Mulawi, nawo wamuuza viyogendelela. <verse eid="JDG 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 18:16" />Waja wanhu magana sita kulawa kabila da Dani, waisasala kwa ng'hondo, wema kuna ulwivi ulukulu. <verse eid="JDG 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 18:17" />Wanhu waja watano wahitile kuipelemba isi wengila kugati, wasola chizibawo na nyang'hiti za milungu na nyang'hiti zihakigwe shaba, lusita ulo mkulu wa nhambiko ija kakala yemile hamwe na waja wanhu magana sita weli na silaha. Viyawawone waja wanhu wopelemba isi <verse eid="JDG 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 18:18" />wengila muna ikaye ya Mika wasola chizibawo chiya na nyang'hiti za milungu na nyang'hiti zihakigwe shaba. Mkulu wa nhambiko kawauza, “Motenda choni?” <verse eid="JDG 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 18:19" />Nawo wamwidika, “Nyamala! Sekeulonge mbuli. Izo hamwe na cheye na uwe tati yetu na mkulu wa nhambiko wetu. Vino vinoga kumwako kuwa mkulu wa nhambiko wa munhu imwe hebu kuwa mkulu wa nhambiko wa kabila da Isilaili?”<verse eid="JDG 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 18:20" />Mkulu wa nhambiko kadeng'helela. Kasola chizibawo na nyang'hiti za milungu na nyang'hiti zihakigwe shaba, kahita hamwe nawo.<verse eid="JDG 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 18:21" />Wandusa mwanza wawo, kuno walongoleligwa na wana wawo na wanyama wawo wa kufugigwa na vinhu vawo. <verse eid="JDG 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 18:22" />Viwafikile kutali na kaye ya Mika, wanhu wakalile habehi na kaye ya Mika watangigwa, wawasondelele wanhu wa kabila da Dani na wawapata. <verse eid="JDG 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 18:23" />Maabaho wawagutila nyangi, wanhu wa kabila da Dani wahinduka na wamuuza Mika, “Kuna choni mbaka kuchisondelela na bumbila dino jose?”<verse eid="JDG 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 18:24" />Mika kawedika, “Musola milungu yangu yonitendile na mkulu wa nhambiko wangu na musegela navo. Lelo modahaze kuniuza nolonda choni?” <verse eid="JDG 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 18:25" />Wanhu wa kabila da Dani wamulongela, “Muhavu uleke gubu jako, buleivo wamwenga wetu weli na ludoko wezakugwila, kwizadanganika weye na ndugu zako.” <verse eid="JDG 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 18:26" />Ivo wanhu wa kabila da Dani wasegela. Mika viyawone wana nguvu kufosa yeye, kahindula na kabwela ukaye yake. <verse eid="JDG 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 18:27" />Wanhu wa kabila da Dani wasola vinhu viyatendile Mika na mkulu wa nhambiko wake, wahita Laishi. Uko wawakoma wakaya wose wokala umo bila kudumba na kwa tindiwalo, waditimbula bululu jose. <verse eid="JDG 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 18:28" />Wakaya wa isi iyo hawakalile na munhu wa kuwakombola kwaviya wakala kutali na bululu da Sidoni, kaidi hawaitogolele na wanhu wa zisi zimwenga kuzigwa. Bululu ijo dikala kuna dikolongo da Besi Lehobu. Wanhu wa kabila da Dani wadizenga kaidi na wakala umo. <verse eid="JDG 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 18:29" />Waditanga bululu ijo Dani, kwa kudiyenzi zina da tati yawo Dani, yakalile mwana wa Isilaili, mbali zina da bululu ijo umwaka ditangigwa Laishi. <verse eid="JDG 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 18:30" />Wanhu wa kabila da Dani wasimika nyang'hiti ija ya kusongola. Yonasani mwana wa Gelishomu mwana wa Musa, kawa mkulu wawo wa nhambiko. Welesi wake iviya wawa wakulu wa nhambiko wa kabila da Dani mbaka wanhu wa isi iyo viwagaligwe kuna uuhami. <verse eid="JDG 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 18:31" />Wagendelela kusang'hanila nyang'hiti ziyatendile Mika, lusita lose kaye ya Mulungu viikalile Shilo.<verse eid="JDG 18:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JDG 19" />
  <para style="s">Mulawi na msang'hani wake wa chike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 19:1" />Siku izo Isilaili kukala kwabule mfalume. Kukala na Mulawi imwe yoyakalile fana nyambenyambe yakalile kutali muna iisi ya vilima va Efulaimu, yoyasolile msang'hani wa chike uko Beselehemu muna iisi ya Yuda. <verse eid="JDG 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 19:2" />Mbali msang'hani wa chike iyo kamwihila Mulawi iyo, kamuleka na kabwela ukaye kwa tati yake uko Beselehemu, kakala uko miyezi mine. <verse eid="JDG 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 19:3" />Maabaho mulumake kenuka kamsondelela, yasimulile nayo kwa ulondo muladi yadahe kumbweleza kaidi. Nayo kakala hamwe na msang'hani wake na vihongwe waidi, muke iyo kamkalibisha muna ikaye ya tati yake. Tati yake viyamuwone kadeng'helela kuiwona nayo. <verse eid="JDG 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 19:4" />Mkoi wake, tata wa muke ija kamkalibisha, nayo kakala uko siku nhatu, Mulawi iyo na wasang'hani wake waja ndiya na wang'wa na wagona uko.<verse eid="JDG 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 19:5" />Siku yekane walamuka imitotondo na kuisasala kusegela, mbali tata wa muke ija kamulongela Mulawi, “Teng'hu diya ndiya ubweleze lukuli maabaho kodaha kusegela.” <verse eid="JDG 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 19:6" />Ivo waidi wawo wakala, waja na kung'wa hamwe. Maabaho tata wa imuke kalonga, “Nokulamba ukale chilo chose na udeng'helele.” <verse eid="JDG 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 19:7" />Munhu ija viyenuke muladi yanduse mwanza, mkoi wake kamuhimiza yasigale, nayo kasigala chilo chimwenga chimwe. <verse eid="JDG 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 19:8" />Siku yetano imitondo kalamka muladi yasegele, tata wa imuke kalonga, “Humuza moyo wako. Gozela mbaka imisi.” Ivo waidi wawo waja hamwe.<verse eid="JDG 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 19:9" />Maabaho munhu ija na muke wake na msang'hani wake, wenuka muladi wasegele, mkoi wake kamulongela, “Lola, sambi ichilo kala hano uhoze moyo wako. Igolo imitondo ng'hani kodaha kulamka na kusegela.”<verse eid="JDG 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 19:10" />Mbali munhu iyo ichilo icho kalema kugona, ivo kenuka na kasegela, kafika habehi na bululu da Yebusi, niiyo Yelusalemu. Kahita na vihongwe waidi wasasaligwe, hamwe na msang'hani wake wa chike. <verse eid="JDG 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 19:11" />Viwakalile habehi na Yebusi, zuwa dikala diswile, msang'hani kamulongela mwenevale wake, “Muhavu chingile muna dibululu dino da Wayebusi chigone ichilo chino.” <verse eid="JDG 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 19:12" />Mwenevale wake kamwidika, “Hachidaha kwingila muna dibululu da nyambenyambe weli siyo Waisilaili, chizagendelela na mwanza mbaka chifike Gibea.” <verse eid="JDG 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 19:13" />Kongeza kulonga, “Izo, leka chigeze kufika Gibea hebu Lama na chizagona muna dibululu dimwe mwa mabululu yayo.” <verse eid="JDG 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 19:14" />Ivo wagendelela na mwanza wawo. Viwafikile Gibea dili bululu da kabila da Benyamini zuwa diswa. <verse eid="JDG 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 19:15" />Wengila muna dibululu ijo muladi wagone ichilo. Viwengile wahita kukala kuna ulubuga lwa bululu, mbali habule munhu yawahokele ukaye yake.<verse eid="JDG 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 19:16" />Viwakalile uko mulala imwe keza kulawa kuna umgunda wake. Mulala iyo kakala mkaya wa isi ya vilima ya Efulaimu na kakala uko Gibea fana nyambenyambe. Wakaya wa bululu da Gibea wakala wa kabila da Benyamini. <verse eid="JDG 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 19:17" />Mulala iyo viyalolile na kumuwona mfosanzila kuna ulubuga lwa bululu, kamuuza, “Kohita kulihi? Kolawa kulihi?” <verse eid="JDG 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 19:18" />Mulawi kedika, “Cheye chofosa nzila, chilawa bululu da Beselehemu dili kuna iisi ya Yuda, chohita kutali kuna ivilima va Efulaimu, konikala. Nikala Beselehemu ili Yuda na sambi nohita kuna ikaye ya Mndewa Mulungu. Habule hata munhu imwe yanihokele muna ikaye yake. <verse eid="JDG 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 19:19" />Mbali cheye wasang'hani wako china nyasi kwa ichimu cha chihongwe wetu. Iviya nina gate na divai, ivo vonifaya niye na msang'hani wako wa chike na wasang'hani wako. Hachihungukilwa na chinhu chochose.”<verse eid="JDG 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 19:20" />Mulala ija kalonga, “Muwe na tindiwalo! Nizamwing'hani vinhu vose vomulonda. Mbali sekemugone hana ulubuga ichilo.” <verse eid="JDG 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 19:21" />Ivo kawagala ukaye yake na kaweng'ha nyasi vihongwe wawo. Nyambenyambe wawo wanawa magulu yawo, waja na kung'wa. <verse eid="JDG 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 19:22" />Viwakalile wodeng'helela, walume wotenda yehile wa bululu ijo weza waizinga ikaye iyo na kuhodiza. Wamulongela mulala mwene kaye, “Mulave mulume iyo yeli kumwako chimbandame.”<verse eid="JDG 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 19:23" />Mwene kaye kalawa kunze, kawalongela, “Bule mbwiya zangu! Nomulambani sekemutende mbuli ihile fana iyo. Nyambenyambe ino kokala kumwangu, ivo sekemumtendele mbuli zilingile ivo. <verse eid="JDG 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 19:24" />Hano hana msang'hani wa chike wa nyambenyambe yokala kumwangu na mndele wangu yeli mhambe, nitogoleleni niwalave kunze muladi muwasole na kuwatendela vomulonda, mbali munhu ino sekemumtendele mbuli ino ihile.” <verse eid="JDG 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 19:25" />Mbali walume wawo hawamuhulike bule. Ivo Mulawi ija kamsola msang'hani wa chike na kawalavila kunze. Nawo wamsola na kumtenda yambule mwiko ichilo chose mbaka imitondo. Viiwile habehi na kukunguzuka wamuleka yahite.<verse eid="JDG 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 19:26" />Imitondo muke ija keza mbaka kuna ulwivi lwa kaye iyakalile mulumake, kagwa hasi baho hana ulwivi na kakala hasi mbaka vikukunguzuke ng'hani. <verse eid="JDG 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 19:27" />Imitondo mulumake kalamka, viyavugule ulwivi muladi yasegele, kamuwona suliya wake kagona kuna ulwivi lwa kaye na mikono yake kagimila ichizingiti. <verse eid="JDG 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 19:28" />Kamulongela, “Inuka chihite.” Mbali hedikigwe bule. Maabaho kamkweza muke ija muna ichihongwe wake na kamgala ukaye. <verse eid="JDG 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 19:29" />Viyengile muna ikaye yake kasola mwele, maabaho kamwamha msang'hani wa chike na kamkanhakanha vihande longo na vidi na kavituma kuna zimhaka zose za Isilaili. <verse eid="JDG 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 19:30" />Chila munhu yawonile ivo kalonga, “Mbuli fana iyo hainalawilila hebu kuwoneka kwandusila Waisilaili viwasegele Misili mbaka diyelo. Geseni na lamuleni muladi mukalonge.”<verse eid="JDG 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JDG 20" />
  <para style="s">Waisilaili woitowa na wanhu wa kabila da Benyamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 20:1" />Waisilaili wose kwandusila bululu da Dani mbaka bululu da Belisheba na kwandusila isi ya Gileadi weza na waiting'hana haulongozi ha Mndewa Mulungu uko Misipa. <verse eid="JDG 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 20:2" />Walangulizi wose wa makabila ya Isilaili walawilila hana umting'hano wa wanhu wa Mulungu. Wose wakala wakalizi 400,000 wogenda na magulu weli na panga. <verse eid="JDG 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 20:3" />Wanhu wa kabila da Benyamini wahulika kuwa Waisilaili wamwenga wose waiting'hana uko Misipa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:3">Waisilaili wauza, “Chilongele, wihi uno utendeka vilihi?”<verse eid="JDG 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 20:4" />Mulawi ija, mulume wa suliya ija kedika, “Niye na msang'hani wangu wa chike chifika Gibea bululu da kabila da Benyamini muladi chigone uko ichilo. <verse eid="JDG 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 20:5" />Mbali wanhu wa Gibea weza ichilo na waizingila kaye inikalile nigonile. Walonda kunikoma, wambandama shuluti msang'hani wangu wa chike mbaka kadanganika. <verse eid="JDG 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 20:6" />Nisola mtufi wake, nikanha vihande vihande na nivigala kwa makabila yose ya Isilaili, kwaviya watenda mbuli ihile na ya kutibusa muna iisi ya Isilaili. <verse eid="JDG 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 20:7" />Mweye Waisilaili mose munilongele chitende choni.”<verse eid="JDG 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 20:8" />Wanhu wose wema fana munhu imwe, walonga, “Cheye wose hachizahita ukaye. Habule hata imwe wetu yondayabwele ukaye yake. <verse eid="JDG 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 20:9" />Vino niivo vondachiitendele Gibea. Chizatowa mhiya viya voilondeka kuwatowa. <verse eid="JDG 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 20:10" />Chizasagula wanhu longo mwa chila wanhu gana wa Isilaili, wanhu gana mwa chila wanhu magana longo mwa wanhu magana magana, wanhu magana longo mwa chila wanhu 10,000, wawagalile wanhu ndiya. Watowang'hondo vondawafike bululu da Gibea da kabila da Benyamini, wezawatendela yaja yolondeka kwa ichimu cha wihi uno uwatendile muna iisi ya Isilaili.” <verse eid="JDG 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 20:11" />Ivo walume wose wa Isilaili waiting'hana kwa moyo umwe kwa ichimu cha kuditowa bululu da Gibea.<verse eid="JDG 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 20:12" />Wanhu wa makabila ya Isilaili watuma wasenga mbaka chila hanhu ha kabila da Benyamini, walonga, “Vino uno ni wihi waki woulawilile kumwenu? <verse eid="JDG 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 20:13" />Lelo ching'heni wanhu wawo wotenda yehile wa Gibea muladi chiwakome na kwagiza wihi uno muna iisi ya Isilaili.” Mbali wanhu wa kabila da Benyamini hawawategeleze ndugu zawo Waisilaili. <verse eid="JDG 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 20:14" />Wanhu kulawa makabila yose ya Benyamini weza Gibea kuitowa na wanhu wa Isilaili. <verse eid="JDG 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 20:15" />Wanhu wa kabila da Benyamini waiduganya kulawa muna yamabululu yawo, watowang'hondo 26,000 wosang'hanila silaha, na wakaya wa bululu magana saba da Gibea waduganya wanhu wowasaguligwe. <verse eid="JDG 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 20:16" />Hagati ya wanhu wawo wose wasaguligwe, kukala na watowang'hondo magana saba wowasang'hanile makono ya kumoso, chila munhu kodaha kupigisa dibwe kwa ng'humbewe kulenga nyele bila kuhonya. <verse eid="JDG 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 20:17" />Waisilaili wose, bila ya kabila da Benyamini waduganya wanhu 400,000 wowodaha kusang'hanila silaha. Wose wakala magalu wa ng'hondo. <verse eid="JDG 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 20:18" />Waisilaili wahita Beseli kumuuza Mulungu, muladi wavimanye kabila dondajanduse kuitowa na wanhu wa kabila da Benyamini. Mndewa Mulungu katambula kabila da Yuda diwe da mwanduso.<verse eid="JDG 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 20:19" />Igolo yake imitondo Waisilaili wahita na weka lago jawo habehi na Gibea <verse eid="JDG 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 20:20" />Waisilaili walawa kuitowa na kabila da Benyamini habehi na Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 20:21" />Wanhu wa kabila da Benyamini walawa kunze ya bululu da Gibea waitowa na Waisilaili. Siku iyo wawakoma walume wa Isilaili 22,000. <verse eid="JDG 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 20:22" />Mbali Waisilaili waing'ha moyo, waisasala kaidi kwa ng'hondo hanhu haja howaisasale uchanduso. <verse eid="JDG 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 20:23" />Waisilaili wahita, wamulilila Mndewa Mulungu mbaka ichigulogulo. Maabaho wamuuza Mndewa Mulungu, “Vino chihite kaidi kuitowa na ndugu zetu wa kabila da Benyamini?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:23">Mndewa Mulungu kawedika, “Hiteni mukaitowe nawo.” <verse eid="JDG 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 20:24" />Igolo yake Waisilaili wahita kuitowa na wanhu wa kabila da Benyamini. <verse eid="JDG 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 20:25" />Siku iyo wanhu wa kabila da Benyamini walawa Gibea na kuwatowa Waisilaili, wawakoma Waisilaili watowang'hondo 18,000. <verse eid="JDG 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 20:26" />Waisilaili wose wahita Beseli na kulila. Wakala uko haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu, waomboleza na kufunga mbaka ichigulogulo. Wamulavila Mndewa Mulungu nhambiko za kutimbula na nhambiko za kugala tindiwalo. <verse eid="JDG 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 20:27" />Waisilaili wampula Mndewa Mulungu yawataze. Siku izo sanduku da lagano da Mndewa Mulungu dikala uko Beseli. <verse eid="JDG 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 20:28" />Finehasi mwana wa Eleazali, mwana wa Haluni, iyo yakalile mkulu wa nhambiko siku izo. Waisilaili wamuuza Mndewa Mulungu, “Vilihi chihite kaidi kuitowa na ndugu zetu wa kabila da Benyamini?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:28">Mndewa Mulungu kawedika, “Hiteni, kwaviya igolo nizawatenda muwahume.”<verse eid="JDG 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 20:29" />Ivo Waisilaili weka watowang'hondo waifisile kudizunguluka bululu da Gibea <verse eid="JDG 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 20:30" />Siku yetatu Waisilaili wahita kuitowa na wanhu wa kabila da Benyamini, waisasala kuitowa na Gibea fana viwatendile umwaka. <verse eid="JDG 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 20:31" />Wanhu wa kabila da Benyamini viwalawile kuna dibululu kuitowa na Waisilaili, wakwesigwa kutali na bululu. Ilawilila fana viwatendile umwaka kuwatowa Waisilaili muna zinzila zing'hulu, imwe yoihita Beseli na imwenga yoihita Gibea. Wawakoma Waisilaili fana viya malongo matatu kuna imigunda. <verse eid="JDG 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 20:32" />Wanhu wa kabila da Benyamini walonga, “Chohuma fana umwaka.” Mbali Waisilaili walonga, “Chikimbile muladi chiwakwese kulawa kutali na bululu mbaka kuna inzila ing'hulu.” <verse eid="JDG 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 20:33" />Ivo Waisilaili wose walawa hanhu hawo na wahita kuipanga kaidi uko Baali Tamali. Wayawo wakalile waifisile na walawa himahima hanhu baho ubanzi wa uswelo wa zuwa wa Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 20:34" />Walume 10,000 wowasaguligwe kulawa muna yamakabila yose ya Isilaili, wafika Gibea. Ng'hondo ikala ichaga, ivo wanhu wa kabila da Benyamini hawavimanyile kuwa wahabehi kunangigwa. <verse eid="JDG 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 20:35" />Mndewa Mulungu kawatenda Waisilaili wawahume wanhu wa kabila da Benyamini. Muna isiku iyo Waisilaili wawakoma wanhu wa kabila da Benyamini 25,100, wose wakala wakalizi wosang'hanila silaha. <verse eid="JDG 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 20:36" />Ivo wanhu wa kabila da Benyamini wawona kuwa wahumigwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:36">Waisilaili wabwela ukaye fana wowakimbila wanhu wa kabila da Benyamini, kwaviya wawahuwila wayawo wakalile wodisepa bululu da Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 20:37" />Wanhu waja waifisile walawa hima na kuditowa bululu da Gibea na kuwakoma kwa upanga wanhu wose wakalile umo. <verse eid="JDG 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 20:38" />Chilaguso chiwailagane Waisilaili na wanhu waja waifisile wahadiwona yosi dikwela kuchany'ha kulawa muna dibululu ijo. <verse eid="JDG 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 20:39" />Maabaho Waisilaili wahinduka kuna ing'hondo ija, wanhu wa kabila da Benyamini wandusa kuwatowa na kuwakoma Waisilaili fana viyamalongo matatu, kwaviya walonga, “Chiwahuma fana kuna ing'hondo ya ichanduso.” <verse eid="JDG 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 20:40" />Mbali wingu ijo vijanduse kukwela kulawa kuna dibululu, dilingile fana mhanda ya yosi, wanhu wa kabila da Benyamini walola kuchisogo na wawona bululu jose dokwela uchanyha kuna diyosi kuhita kuulanga. <verse eid="JDG 20:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JDG 20:41" />Maabaho Waisilaili wahinduka, wanhu wa kabila da Benyamini wadumba, kwaviya wavimanya kuwa wezanangigwa. <verse eid="JDG 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JDG 20:42" />Ivo wahinduka na wawakimbila Waisilaili wahita kuna dibwilingu, mbali wakumbigwa na ng'hondo, waifika wahagati ya mabumbila maidi ya watowang'hondo wa Isilaili na watowang'hondo walawile muna ya mabululu wawananga. <verse eid="JDG 20:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JDG 20:43" />Waisilaili wawazinga wanhu wa kabila da Benyamini, wawasondelela kulawa Noha mbaka ulawilo wa zuwa wa bululu da Gibea, uko wawakoma wengi wawo. <verse eid="JDG 20:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JDG 20:44" />Siku iyo wakomigwa walume 18,000 wa kabila da Benyamini, wawo wose wakala magalu. <verse eid="JDG 20:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JDG 20:45" />Wanhu wamwenga wa kabila da Benyamini wahinduka, wakimbilila kuhita kudibwilingu mbaka luwe lwa Limoni. Wanhu wamwenga 5,000 wakomigwa kuna inzila ng'hulu viwakalile wokimbila. Waisilaili wagendelela kuwasondelela ng'hani wanhu wa kabila da Benyamini mbaka bululu da Gidomu na wawakoma wanhu 2,000. <verse eid="JDG 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JDG 20:46" />Wanhu wose wa kabila da Benyamini wakomigwe siku iyo wakala 25,000, wawo wose wakala magalu. <verse eid="JDG 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JDG 20:47" />Mbali walume magana sita wahinduka na wakimbilila kudibwilingu kuna uluwe lwa Limoni, uko wakala miyezi mine. <verse eid="JDG 20:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JDG 20:48" />Walume wa Isilaili wawabwelela wanhu wa kabila da Benyamini na wawakoma wanhu wose na wanyama. Wayatimbula mabululu yose yowafikile uko.<verse eid="JDG 20:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JDG 21" />
  <para style="s">Wanhu wa kabila da Benyamini wokwing'higwa wanaake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 21:1" />Waisilaili wailaha uko Misipa, walonga, “Habule munhu yoyose kumwetu yondayamfungile zengele mwanage kwa wanhu wa kabila da Benyamini.” <verse eid="JDG 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 21:2" />Wanhu weza Beseli na wakala haulongozi ha Mulungu mbaka ichigulogulo. Walandula madizi yawo na wamulilila ng'hani. <verse eid="JDG 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 21:3" />Walonga, “Weye Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wa Isilaili, habali mbuli ino ilawilila mbaka chihungukilwe na kabila muna iisi ya Isilaili?”<verse eid="JDG 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 21:4" />Igolo yake imitondo ng'hani wanhu wazenga lupango uko na walava nhambiko za kutimbula na nhambiko za kugala tindiwalo. <verse eid="JDG 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 21:5" />Maabaho Waisilaili wauza, “Yelihi mwa Waisilaili hawile uko kuna umting'hano woutendeke haulongozi ha Mndewa Mulungu?” Kwaviya wakala wailaha kuwa munhu yondayaswele kuwa uko Misipa haulongozi ha Mndewa Mulungu kolondeka yakomigwe. <verse eid="JDG 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 21:6" />Waisilaili wawawonela ubazi ndugu zawo wa kabila da Benyamini, walonga, “Diyelo kabila dimwe da Isilaili dinangigwa. <verse eid="JDG 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 21:7" />Lelo chizatendaze muladi kuwapatila wanaake walume wa kabila da Benyamini wowasigale? Kwaviya chiilaha kwa zina da Mndewa Mulungu kuwa hachizaweng'ha wanetu wawe wake zawo!”<verse eid="JDG 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 21:8" />Maabaho walonga, “Kabila dilihi muna yamakabila ya Isilaili hadifikile haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu uko Misipa?” Habule munhu yoyose kulawa Yabeshi ili Gileadi yakalile uko. <verse eid="JDG 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 21:9" />Waisilaili viwapetigwe uko Misipa habule mkaya yoyose wa Yabeshi ili Gileadi yoyakalile uko. <verse eid="JDG 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 21:10" />Ivo mting'hano wa Waisilaili wawatuma wanhu wawo 12,000 weli magalu ng'hani, wawalagiliza, “Hiteni mukawakome wakaya wa Yabeshi Gileadi, wanaake hamwe na wana. <verse eid="JDG 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 21:11" />Molondeka mutende vino, wakomeni walume wose na wanaake wose weli siyo mhambe.” <verse eid="JDG 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 21:12" />Mwa wanhu wose wa Yabeshi Gileadi mhambe wakala 400 hawanaibanda na mulume, ivo wawasola na wawagala kuna dilago uko Shilo kuna iisi ya Kanaani.<verse eid="JDG 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 21:13" />Maabaho mting'hano wose watuma usenga wa tindiwalo kwa wanhu wa kabila da Benyamini wowakalile kuna uluwe lwa Limoni. <verse eid="JDG 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 21:14" />Siku izo wanhu wa kabila da Benyamini wabwela na weng'higwa wanaake wa Yabeshi Gileadi wowasigale. Mbali wanaake wawo hawenele walume wose.<verse eid="JDG 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 21:15" />Wanhu wawawonela ubazi wanhu wa kabila da Benyamini kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu katenda wanhu wa makabila ya Isilaili wahunguke. <verse eid="JDG 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 21:16" />Ivo walala wa mting'hano walonga, “Wanaake wose wa kabila da Benyamini wanangigwa, lelo chizatendaze kuwapatila wanaake walume wasigale?” <verse eid="JDG 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 21:17" />Walonga, “Walume wasigale wa kabila da Benyamini wolondeka weng'higwe wanaake muladi wagendese kabila, ivo sekejage kabila jojose mwa makabila ya Isilaili. <verse eid="JDG 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 21:18" />Mbali hachidaha kuwatogolela wawo wasole wandele wetu wawe wake zawo.” Kwaviya Waisilaili wailaha, “Yaduwiligwe munhu yoyose yondayamfungile zengele mwanage kwa wanhu wa kabila da Benyamini.” <verse eid="JDG 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 21:19" />Maabaho walonga, “Dugila da Mndewa Mulungu da chila mwaka uko Shilo ili ubanzi wa kasikazi wa Beseli, ubanzi wa ulawilo wa zuwa wa nzila ng'hulu yoihita kulawa Beseli kuhita Shekemu, ubanzi wa kusi wa Lebona.” <verse eid="JDG 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 21:20" />Wawalagiliza wanhu wa kabila da Benyamini, walonga, “Hiteni mukaifise kuna imigunda ya mizabibu <verse eid="JDG 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 21:21" />na mulole. Wanaake wadododo wa Shilo wondaweze kuvina kuna didugila, laweni kunze ya migunda ya mizabibu. Chila imwe wenu yasole muke kwa shuluti na mubwele nawo kuna iisi ya Benyamini. <verse eid="JDG 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 21:22" />One tati zawo hebu lumbu zawo waheza kumwenu kumulongani, longeni, ‘Cholamba, lekeni chiwasole kwaviya hachiwasolile kulawa kumwenu kuna ing'hondo kuwa wake zetu. Kwaviya hamuching'hile hamwizatagusigwa bule.’ ”<verse eid="JDG 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 21:23" />Wanhu wa kabila da Benyamini watenda vino, chila munhu kasagula muke mwa wanaake wakalile wovina uko Shilo na kusegela nayo. Maabaho wabwela kuna yamabululu yawo, wazenga kaidi mabululu yawo na wakala umo. <verse eid="JDG 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 21:24" />Lusita ulo ulo Waisilaili wasegela, chila munhu kabwela kuna dibululu na wanhu wake na kabila jake. Chila munhu kabwela hanhu hoyeng'higwe.<verse eid="JDG 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 21:25" />Siku izo Isilaili kukala kwabule mfalume, chila munhu katenda viyolonda.<verse eid="JDG 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 21" />
</usx>